WEBVTT

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:19.910
In this vast universe...

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:21.500
begins...

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:26.000
a story that took place in a small country

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.880
on a small planet.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.800
I didn't see it with my own eyes, but...

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:37.510
my family...

00:00:37.510 --> 00:00:42.770
and the friends I hold dear told me about it.

00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:49.570
It all started in June, two years ago.

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:50.420
Thank you.

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:09.480
You have one new message.

00:02:10.150 --> 00:02:14.110
Hello, this is Dr. Ishida from
Uminari University Hospital.

00:02:14.110 --> 00:02:17.490
Well, tomorrow's your birthday, Hayate.

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:23.240
How about we go out to lunch
after your checkup?

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:28.040
Could you let me know
before you come tomorrow?

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:29.000
I'll be waiting, then.

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:32.000
End of messages.

00:03:50.540 --> 00:03:52.540
Disengaging the seal.

00:04:03.180 --> 00:04:04.180
Activating.

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:46.140
Good morning, Master.

00:04:47.550 --> 00:04:50.770
Good morning to you too, Raising Heart!

00:04:53.180 --> 00:04:54.890
This spring,

00:04:54.890 --> 00:04:58.110
I had a few life-changing encounters.

00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:08.410
I met Yuuno, my magic teacher,
and was brought into the world of magic.

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:12.700
I also met my dear partner, Raising Heart.

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:15.250
And then...

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:17.540
there was Fate.

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:38.480
I first met Fate

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:41.690
half a year ago.

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:46.110
We didn't always see eye to eye.

00:05:46.110 --> 00:05:49.530
We clashed and fought because
of our misunderstandings.

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:52.700
Those encounters were
full of pain and sorrow.

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:56.250
A lot happened in a short time.

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:58.210
And I mean a lot.

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:01.500
But Fate...

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:05.630
she returned my feelings with all her heart,

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:08.180
and we became friends.

00:06:10.220 --> 00:06:11.680
We went our separate ways,

00:06:12.260 --> 00:06:14.180
but we can finally meet again.

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:33.410
Fate...

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:37.710
Nanoha...

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:41.540
Fate!

00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:52.550
Welcome back, Fate.

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:55.060
I'm back, Nanoha.

00:07:15.490 --> 00:07:19.460
You think Fate's in tears
after seeing her again?

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:21.080
Probably.

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:32.130
You want this mattress upstairs, ma'am?

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:33.840
Yes, please!

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:43.230
Hey, careful.

00:07:43.230 --> 00:07:44.190
Yeah.

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:50.190
We have a new friend joining us today.

00:07:52.530 --> 00:07:54.200
A transfer student?

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:55.450
A boy? A girl?

00:07:56.780 --> 00:07:58.790
Fate, come in.

00:07:58.790 --> 00:08:01.080
E-Excuse me.

00:08:08.670 --> 00:08:10.340
I'm Fate Testarossa.

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:12.680
Pleased to meet you.

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:25.770
Yeah, we're pretty much done moving in.

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:26.770
Is that so?

00:08:27.270 --> 00:08:29.820
Arf was a great help.

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:31.690
No, not at all.

00:08:31.690 --> 00:08:35.160
You can finally relax a bit now, Captain.

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:36.780
That's right.

00:08:37.740 --> 00:08:39.990
I'll try to get the most out of it.

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:43.830
We'll contact you again.

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:46.130
Arf, say hi to Fate for me.

00:08:46.130 --> 00:08:47.080
Sure.

00:08:48.340 --> 00:08:49.130
Alright.

00:08:49.550 --> 00:08:52.670
Let's take a short break, then go shopping.

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:54.050
Alright, sure.

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:59.560
I still don't know much about this world,

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:00.890
so I'm counting on you.

00:09:01.350 --> 00:09:02.520
Leave it to me.

00:09:15.030 --> 00:09:17.160
Well, um...

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:18.990
Admiral Lindy?

00:09:19.530 --> 00:09:24.000
Thank you for everything you've done for Fate.

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:28.790
Oh my, where'd that come from?

00:09:29.790 --> 00:09:35.380
I'm grateful to everyone for helping
with Fate's mage exam, and the trial.

00:09:35.380 --> 00:09:37.300
Everyone's been so kind.

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:42.140
You really went out of your way
for Fate <i>and</i> Nanoha.

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:46.480
I'm Fate and your legal guardian.
Of course I did.

00:09:47.900 --> 00:09:52.190
But to move and go to school in this world...

00:09:52.190 --> 00:09:54.440
I'm glad Fate happily accepted.

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:57.860
When Fate first heard about it,

00:09:57.860 --> 00:10:00.740
she cried the whole night.

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:04.080
She was so happy and excited.

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:10.580
Both you and Fate went through a lot.

00:10:10.580 --> 00:10:15.010
But from now on,
you get to choose your own future.

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:16.720
Yeah.

00:10:17.170 --> 00:10:20.640
You kids are so sweet,
I can't help but love you.

00:10:20.640 --> 00:10:24.560
I'd be happy if you stayed with me forever.

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:26.980
Thank you.

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:38.860
Chrono, Amy, how have you been?

00:10:38.860 --> 00:10:41.820
Admiral Leti, it's been a while.

00:10:41.820 --> 00:10:42.990
Hello, ma'am.

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:46.910
Fate left already?

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:50.210
Yes, she should be at school by now.

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:50.750
I see.

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:54.420
Lindy's with her, so she can rest for a while.

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:55.170
Right.

00:10:57.010 --> 00:11:00.510
Now, about the case I want
you to handle, Chrono.

00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:01.930
Yes, ma'am.

00:11:07.020 --> 00:11:10.310
Track and arrest the assailants.

00:11:11.190 --> 00:11:16.820
Their main violations are the hunting
of large animals and attacks on mages.

00:11:16.820 --> 00:11:18.320
Attacks on mages?

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:21.030
They are attacking them to extract...

00:11:22.700 --> 00:11:25.160
the power source of a mage,

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:26.160
the Linker Core.

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:33.920
Fate, Nanoha, bye!

00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:35.000
See you tomorrow!

00:11:36.050 --> 00:11:37.500
See ya!

00:11:40.510 --> 00:11:44.140
Nanoha and Fate
both seemed so happy.

00:11:44.140 --> 00:11:49.140
You're right. I haven't seen
Nanoha that happy in a while.

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:49.890
Yeah!

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:56.860
Fate, what'd you think of school?

00:11:56.860 --> 00:12:01.900
The teacher and our classmates
are all so kind, so I think I'll be fine.

00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:02.820
I'm glad to hear it!

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:07.330
Oh yeah, I have a lot of things
from Yuuno and Chrono for you.

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:13.830
Like study materials on magic
and a new training program.

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:17.540
We can work on them together.

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:22.340
Yeah, that's right! We can practice
magic together from now on!

00:12:22.340 --> 00:12:23.050
Yeah.

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:27.550
I feel a bit bad keeping Arisa
and Suzuka in the dark, though.

00:12:27.550 --> 00:12:32.350
Well, we shouldn't make them worry.
Plus, there are other reasons...

00:12:37.060 --> 00:12:38.980
Listen, Nanoha.

00:12:39.780 --> 00:12:43.150
There are so many things
I don't know about school

00:12:43.150 --> 00:12:46.160
or about this world in general.

00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:52.200
I may cause trouble for you
and make you worry, but...

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:53.710
It's fine.

00:12:54.420 --> 00:12:57.040
I'd feel the same way if I were you!

00:12:59.420 --> 00:13:01.510
Well, I'll...

00:13:01.510 --> 00:13:03.010
I'll do my best.

00:13:07.180 --> 00:13:09.850
I'll be in your care from now on, Nanoha.

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:15.850
And I'll be in yours, Fate!

00:13:25.900 --> 00:13:29.410
Did you get to catch up with Fate?

00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:29.990
Yep!

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:33.200
Yuuno, are you busy with work?

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:35.500
Yeah, I guess so.

00:13:36.120 --> 00:13:39.000
The Infinity Library is massive, after all.

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:40.460
I see.

00:13:43.130 --> 00:13:45.470
Fate, I'm ready!

00:13:46.130 --> 00:13:49.850
Oh my, Arf!
Why have you become so small?

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:53.310
Because a wolf would stand out too much.

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:54.730
We're playing it smart.

00:13:54.730 --> 00:13:55.930
I see.

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:58.440
We're going for a walk.

00:13:58.440 --> 00:14:00.810
Okay, be careful.

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:15.040
A major mana reading has been detected.

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:16.290
Alright.

00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:20.830
Let's do this, Graf Eisen.

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:21.840
Yes, Master.

00:14:23.800 --> 00:14:25.420
Prison of Magic!

00:14:39.350 --> 00:14:41.440
Caution! Emergency!

00:14:43.940 --> 00:14:45.280
A barrier?!

00:14:46.440 --> 00:14:47.950
Communications down.

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:50.320
Something is approaching.

00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:55.620
Arf!

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:56.830
Gotcha!

00:15:03.290 --> 00:15:04.210
Incoming.

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:07.920
Homing Bullet.

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:22.730
Fatal Blow!

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:35.160
Raising Heart, please!

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:37.870
Stand by, Ready. Set up.

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:41.460
Swallow's Flight!

00:15:41.460 --> 00:15:42.210
Go!

00:15:49.170 --> 00:15:51.130
An aerial mage!

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:54.550
Why did you ambush me?

00:15:54.550 --> 00:15:56.810
Who are you? What do you want?

00:15:58.430 --> 00:16:01.810
I can't understand if you don't tell me!

00:16:08.860 --> 00:16:10.400
How dare you?!

00:16:11.860 --> 00:16:13.030
Cannon Mode.

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:16.620
Tell me...

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:17.490
Divine...

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:19.950
what's going on!

00:16:19.950 --> 00:16:21.160
Buster.

00:16:34.930 --> 00:16:37.140
Graf Eisen, load...

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:38.850
cartridge!

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:40.020
Explosion.

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:44.100
Rocket Form.

00:16:54.450 --> 00:16:56.320
Raketen...

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:11.760
Hammer!

00:17:25.890 --> 00:17:26.730
Protection!

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:33.240
Smash through!

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:33.940
Yes, Master.

00:18:08.730 --> 00:18:10.810
Book of Darkness, absorb.

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:31.710
Nanoha!

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:33.840
Nanoha, answer me!

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:38.180
Decline in mana energy reading. Raising Heart is not responding.

00:18:42.550 --> 00:18:45.310
What's this ominous feeling?

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:48.310
Yes, from Fate and Arf.

00:18:49.850 --> 00:18:52.810
Confirmed it!
A seal-type capturing barrier.

00:18:57.780 --> 00:19:00.910
Contact in 16 seconds.

00:19:01.030 --> 00:19:04.030
Damn it, I need more time for this one.

00:19:04.030 --> 00:19:06.790
No problem. General is here.

00:19:07.580 --> 00:19:11.920
Signum... Shamal and Zafira, too...

00:19:17.130 --> 00:19:19.130
You shall go

00:19:19.130 --> 00:19:20.260
no further.

00:19:33.480 --> 00:19:35.150
I'm sorry, dear.

00:19:35.150 --> 00:19:36.020
But...

00:19:36.570 --> 00:19:37.780
keep still.

00:19:50.460 --> 00:19:51.210
Hm...

00:19:51.410 --> 00:19:54.250
Not bad swordplay for a mage.

00:19:54.250 --> 00:19:55.630
Yes, Master.

00:20:12.140 --> 00:20:13.310
Nanoha!

00:20:19.070 --> 00:20:19.860
Laevatein.

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:21.110
Explosion!

00:20:22.110 --> 00:20:23.160
Sword...

00:20:26.160 --> 00:20:27.160
Flash!

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:48.430
Absorption complete.

00:20:49.180 --> 00:20:52.230
Vita, I've taken out another mage.

00:20:52.730 --> 00:20:54.350
Pass me the Book.

00:20:55.060 --> 00:20:55.810
Here.

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:05.200
Let's go, Eisen.

00:21:05.200 --> 00:21:06.200
Yes, Master.

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:17.380
Impressive.

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:19.210
Still moving?

00:21:25.510 --> 00:21:28.300
Is she family or something?

00:21:29.680 --> 00:21:30.760
She's my friend.

00:21:31.890 --> 00:21:34.680
We've been apart.
I finally got to see her.

00:21:35.520 --> 00:21:36.690
She's my best friend!

00:21:37.940 --> 00:21:40.610
I see. Sorry about that.

00:21:41.780 --> 00:21:43.190
But like you,

00:21:43.690 --> 00:21:45.200
I have my reasons.

00:22:13.560 --> 00:22:16.100
Let's head back now.

00:22:36.500 --> 00:22:37.040
Yes.

00:22:37.660 --> 00:22:39.500
They're not injured.

00:22:40.040 --> 00:22:42.250
Just asleep for now.

00:22:43.130 --> 00:22:45.050
We have two problems.

00:22:45.840 --> 00:22:50.050
There's been a temporary decline in their mana
output due to the draining of their Linker Cores.

00:22:50.510 --> 00:22:51.800
And all three of them

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:56.850
have sustained serious injuries,
but they've been treated.

00:22:58.270 --> 00:23:00.940
As you all know, this is an emergency!

00:23:01.350 --> 00:23:03.690
This team will now begin to investigate

00:23:03.980 --> 00:23:06.860
the case of the assailants mentioned earlier.

00:23:06.860 --> 00:23:07.690
Yes, sir!

00:23:07.690 --> 00:23:10.660
Let's catch them quickly!

00:23:10.660 --> 00:23:11.950
Yes, ma'am!

00:23:15.080 --> 00:23:17.830
Good, the cores and the
basic frames are unharmed.

00:23:18.250 --> 00:23:21.080
Don't worry. I'll have you fixed in no time.

00:23:26.590 --> 00:23:28.670
Photos from the scene?

00:23:28.670 --> 00:23:32.590
Valuable data Raising Heart
and Bardiche recorded for us.

00:23:40.310 --> 00:23:41.060
Chrono?

00:23:41.440 --> 00:23:44.110
You recognize that book?

00:23:45.520 --> 00:23:47.730
A Lost Logia, the Book of Darkness.

00:23:47.730 --> 00:23:51.200
A Class 1 dangerous relic from ancient Belka.

00:23:52.410 --> 00:23:54.200
The Book of Darkness?! You mean...

00:24:35.070 --> 00:24:37.990
Good morning, Book of Darkness.

00:24:45.750 --> 00:24:46.710
Nanoha!

00:24:47.380 --> 00:24:48.250
Fate...

00:24:49.130 --> 00:24:50.460
Good morning, Nanoha.

00:24:51.170 --> 00:24:52.630
How are you feeling?

00:24:52.630 --> 00:24:55.840
I can't use magic, but I feel fine physically.

00:24:55.840 --> 00:24:58.680
I see. Same for me and Arf.

00:24:58.680 --> 00:24:59.720
Gotcha.

00:25:00.770 --> 00:25:02.600
Oh yeah, Fate.

00:25:03.060 --> 00:25:06.020
You came to save me, right?

00:25:06.730 --> 00:25:08.860
I'm sorry, and thank you.

00:25:09.360 --> 00:25:10.360
No...

00:25:10.730 --> 00:25:12.490
I couldn't do anything in the end.

00:25:13.280 --> 00:25:16.990
That's not true!
Really, thank you, Fate.

00:25:25.040 --> 00:25:27.500
But who were they?

00:25:28.040 --> 00:25:32.010
Well, I was ambushed, so...

00:25:33.010 --> 00:25:36.890
But Chrono's team is investigating
the case, so it should be fine.

00:25:37.640 --> 00:25:39.390
Yeah, you're right.

00:25:39.680 --> 00:25:40.310
Yeah.

00:25:42.180 --> 00:25:45.940
Oh yeah, Fate, do you
have time after school today?

00:25:46.480 --> 00:25:50.230
I wanna check up on Raising Heart and Bardiche.

00:26:03.540 --> 00:26:06.040
Sorry, did I wake you?

00:26:06.040 --> 00:26:07.540
Oh, not at all.

00:26:09.290 --> 00:26:12.920
You should sleep in a bed,
or you'll catch a cold.

00:26:12.920 --> 00:26:15.590
Oh... S-Sorry...

00:26:16.340 --> 00:26:18.380
Were you up late?

00:26:18.380 --> 00:26:20.890
Yes, a little.

00:26:20.890 --> 00:26:21.640
I see.

00:26:23.560 --> 00:26:26.940
I'm sorry! I slept through my alarm!

00:26:26.940 --> 00:26:28.390
Good morning, Shamal.

00:26:28.980 --> 00:26:30.020
Good morning.

00:26:30.400 --> 00:26:31.860
Good morning, Vita.

00:26:33.320 --> 00:26:34.110
Yeah.

00:26:34.530 --> 00:26:37.490
Come on, Vita. Go wash up.

00:26:44.240 --> 00:26:45.250
Hello.

00:26:45.830 --> 00:26:47.250
Oh, hey Fate.

00:26:47.710 --> 00:26:50.120
And you must be, um...

00:26:50.120 --> 00:26:51.080
Nanoha?

00:26:51.080 --> 00:26:51.750
That's right.

00:26:52.340 --> 00:26:54.920
I'm Mariel Atenza from Engineering.

00:26:54.920 --> 00:26:57.760
Enforcer Chrono and Amy are my seniors.

00:26:57.970 --> 00:26:59.760
I'm Nanoha Takamachi.

00:26:59.970 --> 00:27:01.470
You came to check in on your Devices?

00:27:01.470 --> 00:27:06.850
They're running system checks, so you
can't talk with them, but go ahead.

00:27:06.850 --> 00:27:07.770
Thank you.

00:27:09.020 --> 00:27:12.020
It'll take time, but we'll get them fixed.

00:27:12.480 --> 00:27:13.860
So don't worry.

00:27:14.730 --> 00:27:18.320
They must've been incredibly powerful

00:27:18.320 --> 00:27:20.530
to have damaged your Devices to this extent.

00:27:20.530 --> 00:27:25.540
They were different.
I've never seen magic circles like that.

00:27:25.540 --> 00:27:27.000
They were Belkan.

00:27:27.580 --> 00:27:29.040
And authentic ones, at that.

00:27:30.370 --> 00:27:32.380
Ancient Belka...

00:27:32.380 --> 00:27:35.500
A pure offense magic from ancient times.

00:27:35.500 --> 00:27:38.460
An advanced mage is called a knight.

00:27:38.460 --> 00:27:42.470
Then what was exploding inside their Devices?

00:27:42.800 --> 00:27:44.970
The magic cartridge system.

00:27:45.510 --> 00:27:49.100
They detonate highly compressed
magic cartridges inside their Devices,

00:27:49.560 --> 00:27:52.190
which gives them explosive destructive power.

00:27:52.190 --> 00:27:54.650
It requires a powerful Device
and a talented mage.

00:27:55.150 --> 00:27:59.190
Without both, you end up
with a self-destructing weapon.

00:27:59.740 --> 00:28:02.660
It's a dangerous and unsafe system, but...

00:28:17.420 --> 00:28:18.550
This one?

00:28:18.550 --> 00:28:19.590
Yes!

00:28:21.090 --> 00:28:22.930
Thank you so much.

00:28:24.590 --> 00:28:27.180
Wow, we're the same age?

00:28:27.760 --> 00:28:32.770
I've seen you around here and thought,
"Oh, maybe she's my age."

00:28:33.440 --> 00:28:35.270
Actually, so have I.

00:28:37.860 --> 00:28:40.780
Um, I'm Suzuka Tsukimura.

00:28:41.150 --> 00:28:42.610
Suzuka, huh?

00:28:43.200 --> 00:28:45.570
I'm Hayate Yagami.

00:28:46.200 --> 00:28:47.620
Hayate...

00:28:59.750 --> 00:29:01.340
Hello there.

00:29:01.340 --> 00:29:02.590
Dr. Ishida.

00:29:03.130 --> 00:29:04.880
Thank you for your time.

00:29:04.880 --> 00:29:05.640
Of course.

00:29:07.350 --> 00:29:09.470
Hayate, how have you been feeling?

00:29:09.680 --> 00:29:11.020
Um...

00:29:11.720 --> 00:29:13.020
Same as usual.

00:29:13.560 --> 00:29:17.440
Well, here are the test results from the other day.

00:29:17.440 --> 00:29:21.230
The current treatment hasn't been too effective.

00:29:21.480 --> 00:29:25.150
But we want to continue it to be completely sure.

00:29:25.820 --> 00:29:27.240
What do you think, Hayate?

00:29:27.410 --> 00:29:28.410
Um...

00:29:29.120 --> 00:29:31.120
I'll leave it up to you.

00:29:31.580 --> 00:29:34.330
Are the tests and medication causing any pain?

00:29:34.330 --> 00:29:35.120
Can you handle them?

00:29:36.420 --> 00:29:37.630
I'll stay strong.

00:29:40.500 --> 00:29:45.430
I have this feeling that we'll meet them again.

00:29:45.430 --> 00:29:46.180
Yeah.

00:29:46.180 --> 00:29:48.470
We didn't get to talk to them.

00:29:49.100 --> 00:29:50.470
But next time...

00:29:51.600 --> 00:29:52.310
Yeah.

00:29:52.520 --> 00:29:54.230
You wanna start now?

00:29:54.230 --> 00:29:55.100
Yeah.

00:29:55.730 --> 00:29:57.440
Let's train.

00:30:03.110 --> 00:30:04.570
<i>We'll get stronger.</i>

00:30:04.570 --> 00:30:07.700
<i>So we can confront this sad reality.</i>

00:30:08.280 --> 00:30:11.200
<i>So no one has to get hurt anymore.</i>

00:30:17.710 --> 00:30:18.710
Systems check damages

00:30:20.500 --> 00:30:21.630
All clear

00:30:21.750 --> 00:30:23.000
Functions diagnosis...

00:30:36.390 --> 00:30:40.060
Problem detected

00:30:59.710 --> 00:31:00.420
You came?

00:31:01.000 --> 00:31:02.210
Yeah.

00:31:02.210 --> 00:31:07.590
The TSAB's really on our case now,
so we better be more careful.

00:31:08.220 --> 00:31:12.260
We should start collecting from
worlds farther away from here.

00:31:12.760 --> 00:31:15.180
How many pages have we filled?

00:31:19.390 --> 00:31:21.190
We're on page 290.

00:31:21.850 --> 00:31:24.320
Those two girls contributed a lot.

00:31:24.320 --> 00:31:26.980
So we're almost halfway there.

00:31:26.980 --> 00:31:28.900
Let's not waste any time.

00:31:30.200 --> 00:31:31.950
We'll complete it quickly,

00:31:32.320 --> 00:31:34.370
so we can live in peace.

00:31:35.030 --> 00:31:36.450
With Hayate.

00:31:40.670 --> 00:31:41.540
Ready?

00:31:42.170 --> 00:31:43.210
Yeah.

00:31:47.920 --> 00:31:49.380
That's right.

00:31:49.380 --> 00:31:53.220
I've been put in charge of repairing you.

00:31:53.470 --> 00:31:59.980
Please insert systems including the "CVK792" component to eliminate problem.
A serious problem has arisen in functions.

00:32:00.480 --> 00:32:03.100
But that's too...

00:32:03.480 --> 00:32:08.150
CVK792, the Belkan cartridge system.

00:32:09.820 --> 00:32:10.650
Are you sure?

00:32:11.530 --> 00:32:14.910
Please

00:32:19.120 --> 00:32:20.580
Problem one.

00:32:20.580 --> 00:32:25.540
The figure on the right has
two circles of the same size

00:32:25.540 --> 00:32:30.050
inside a bigger circle with
a circumference of 8 cm.

00:32:31.220 --> 00:32:32.050
Question one.

00:32:32.880 --> 00:32:36.180
What is the radius of the bigger circle?

00:32:38.100 --> 00:32:44.350
The perpetrators can only absorb
mana from a Linker Core once.

00:32:44.350 --> 00:32:44.900
<i>I see.</i>

00:32:45.310 --> 00:32:47.900
<i>That means Nanoha and Fate</i>

00:32:48.320 --> 00:32:50.400
<i>won't be attacked again?</i>

00:32:50.400 --> 00:32:50.900
That's right.

00:32:51.320 --> 00:32:53.820
But you might, Captain.

00:32:53.820 --> 00:32:56.490
<i>You're right, but don't worry.</i>

00:32:56.490 --> 00:32:58.490
<i>I can protect myself.</i>

00:32:59.080 --> 00:33:02.000
<i>Should I cut my break short
and come help you?</i>

00:33:03.330 --> 00:33:05.620
No, we'll handle this. Don't worry.

00:33:07.250 --> 00:33:08.380
<i>Alright.</i>

00:33:08.670 --> 00:33:11.590
Enjoy your time with Fate.

00:33:12.170 --> 00:33:13.670
<i>Will do.</i>

00:33:17.600 --> 00:33:19.930
Leti, do you have a moment?

00:33:21.020 --> 00:33:23.180
Oh, Lindy, how can I help?

00:33:23.180 --> 00:33:25.690
We go way back, don't we?

00:33:26.150 --> 00:33:27.770
Sure, way back.

00:33:28.730 --> 00:33:29.690
Why do you ask?

00:33:30.520 --> 00:33:34.700
Is Chrono investigating a case
related to the Book of Darkness?

00:33:37.620 --> 00:33:40.080
We weren't aware of it at first.

00:33:41.330 --> 00:33:45.870
Many things were different from the
Book of Darkness Incident <i>we</i> know.

00:33:47.250 --> 00:33:51.630
I told Chrono I could have
another team take over, but...

00:33:51.630 --> 00:33:53.010
He refused?

00:33:53.300 --> 00:33:54.510
He did.

00:33:54.880 --> 00:34:00.890
He told me not to tell you he's handling this case.

00:34:00.890 --> 00:34:01.720
I see.

00:34:32.420 --> 00:34:33.170
Now then...

00:34:33.670 --> 00:34:35.920
I'd better start dinner.

00:34:38.430 --> 00:34:41.180
I'm so glad I made it in time.

00:34:41.180 --> 00:34:42.720
Thank you very much.

00:34:43.970 --> 00:34:46.600
Mari, are you okay?

00:34:48.350 --> 00:34:51.610
I'm just fine. How about you two?

00:34:52.110 --> 00:34:53.360
Great.

00:34:53.360 --> 00:34:56.110
Our mana levels are better than ever!

00:34:56.400 --> 00:34:58.280
Such is youth.

00:34:58.280 --> 00:35:01.530
They're ready, so go see them.

00:35:06.620 --> 00:35:08.620
It's been a while, Master.

00:35:08.960 --> 00:35:11.380
Raising Heart's shape...

00:35:11.380 --> 00:35:13.000
Pretty chic, isn't it?

00:35:13.380 --> 00:35:15.380
Yeah, it's cute!

00:35:15.380 --> 00:35:16.260
Bardiche, too!

00:35:17.090 --> 00:35:18.010
Yes, sir.

00:35:18.590 --> 00:35:22.140
Check with them what modifications have been made.

00:35:22.510 --> 00:35:23.390
We will.

00:35:23.390 --> 00:35:25.140
Thank you very much.

00:35:25.140 --> 00:35:26.560
Oh, Fate!

00:35:27.390 --> 00:35:29.270
Arf, what's wrong?

00:35:29.270 --> 00:35:31.350
Well, earlier today,

00:35:31.350 --> 00:35:33.730
I was supposed to meet up
with Admiral Lindy, but...

00:35:34.230 --> 00:35:35.980
I can't get ahold of her.

00:35:36.480 --> 00:35:38.900
Have you heard anything, Fate?

00:35:39.950 --> 00:35:42.410
There's a barrier in the monitored area.

00:35:42.410 --> 00:35:44.990
Ancient Belkan magic systems detected!

00:35:45.280 --> 00:35:48.620
Four on-site members have surrounded the barrier.

00:35:48.620 --> 00:35:51.250
We're attempting to destroy it, but...

00:35:57.960 --> 00:35:59.590
It's really tough!

00:35:59.970 --> 00:36:03.890
Of course. It's a barrier Klarwind and I made.

00:36:04.430 --> 00:36:06.640
TSAB mages will come soon.

00:36:06.890 --> 00:36:08.310
Get a move on!

00:36:08.720 --> 00:36:09.680
Alright!

00:36:10.430 --> 00:36:13.270
<i>I'd rather stay away from here...</i>

00:36:13.270 --> 00:36:17.940
<i>but we can't have mages
near Hayate while we're out.</i>

00:36:25.620 --> 00:36:26.660
So,

00:36:26.660 --> 00:36:28.620
you're their leader?

00:36:30.250 --> 00:36:32.540
Care for a chat?

00:36:33.540 --> 00:36:34.540
A chat?

00:36:34.830 --> 00:36:37.290
A part of the Book of Darkness's system...

00:36:37.290 --> 00:36:41.420
An eternally regenerating program
with its own mind and body...

00:36:42.010 --> 00:36:42.800
The guardian knights,

00:36:43.260 --> 00:36:44.760
the Cloud Knights.

00:36:46.300 --> 00:36:50.600
What are you after with the Book of Darkness?

00:36:51.730 --> 00:36:55.310
We have our own mission and reasons.

00:36:55.310 --> 00:36:57.310
I don't need to answer you.

00:36:57.900 --> 00:36:59.980
What if I told you my family was killed

00:36:59.980 --> 00:37:04.110
11 years ago when the Book went on a rampage?

00:37:10.660 --> 00:37:12.160
Swallow's Flight, Claymore!

00:37:17.710 --> 00:37:19.750
Signum, get it together!

00:37:20.250 --> 00:37:21.920
Right, sorry.

00:37:39.520 --> 00:37:42.320
This is looking dicey.

00:37:42.320 --> 00:37:43.820
No, ma'am.

00:37:46.360 --> 00:37:47.910
A teleportation signature!?

00:37:55.160 --> 00:37:58.420
I'm sorry, Raising Heart.
I know you just came back!

00:37:58.670 --> 00:38:01.170
All right. That's what I'm here for.

00:38:01.960 --> 00:38:02.880
Bardiche, too!

00:38:03.210 --> 00:38:04.260
No problem.

00:38:05.010 --> 00:38:08.390
This is the first launch of a new system.

00:38:08.760 --> 00:38:11.890
Requesting a renewed activation call.

00:38:12.390 --> 00:38:13.140
Okay!

00:38:14.980 --> 00:38:17.520
Raising Heart Excelion!

00:38:17.520 --> 00:38:19.310
Bardiche Assault!

00:38:19.770 --> 00:38:22.480
Set up!

00:42:12.750 --> 00:42:13.630
Activation...

00:42:14.260 --> 00:42:14.880
normal.

00:42:18.510 --> 00:42:21.010
Cartridge unit, functioning normally.

00:42:28.520 --> 00:42:29.350
They're...

00:42:30.310 --> 00:42:32.360
<i>Admiral Lindy, are you okay?</i>

00:42:32.770 --> 00:42:34.610
<i>Yes, for now.</i>

00:42:34.610 --> 00:42:35.360
<i>Thank goodness.</i>

00:42:39.740 --> 00:42:42.330
Their magic powers have already fully recovered?

00:42:42.780 --> 00:42:44.330
That's exceedingly fast.

00:42:45.000 --> 00:42:46.500
Plus, those Devices...

00:42:47.870 --> 00:42:51.960
It doesn't matter!
I'll destroy everything that gets in our way!

00:42:52.460 --> 00:42:53.380
Fate...

00:43:02.850 --> 00:43:07.060
We're not here to fight!
We came here to talk!

00:43:07.230 --> 00:43:11.560
Yeah, right!
You can't shake hands with a clenched fist!

00:43:12.270 --> 00:43:16.070
Look who's talking! You attacked us first!

00:43:20.570 --> 00:43:23.280
You've outlived your usefulness!

00:43:23.910 --> 00:43:25.200
Explosion!

00:43:29.960 --> 00:43:32.710
How about I break a few bones
and cut you down to size!?

00:43:35.880 --> 00:43:36.960
Raising Heart!

00:43:37.300 --> 00:43:39.220
Commencing cartridge load.

00:44:00.820 --> 00:44:01.780
So persistent!

00:44:02.200 --> 00:44:05.080
I won't go down so easily!

00:44:05.370 --> 00:44:07.120
You...

00:44:07.830 --> 00:44:09.710
Smasher!

00:44:19.670 --> 00:44:20.380
You...

00:44:20.880 --> 00:44:22.470
Rest in pieces!

00:44:27.510 --> 00:44:28.680
Accel Shooter.

00:44:29.100 --> 00:44:30.640
Accel...

00:44:30.770 --> 00:44:32.440
Shoot!

00:44:47.910 --> 00:44:51.120
I really just want to talk to you.

00:44:53.250 --> 00:44:56.630
I also want to apologize about your hat.

00:44:58.670 --> 00:45:00.510
So please, be a good girl.

00:45:01.970 --> 00:45:03.300
Shut up, you brat!

00:45:03.720 --> 00:45:05.800
Outta my way or I'll smash you!

00:45:40.000 --> 00:45:41.710
Biting Snake...

00:45:45.800 --> 00:45:47.090
Assault!

00:46:15.370 --> 00:46:16.080
Hm.

00:46:16.790 --> 00:46:19.500
You've improved a lot.

00:46:19.500 --> 00:46:21.460
You must've trained quite a bit.

00:46:21.920 --> 00:46:25.590
Or did you just lose your head last time?

00:46:26.760 --> 00:46:28.470
Thank you.

00:46:28.470 --> 00:46:31.600
I did train more, and I'm prepared this time.

00:46:33.180 --> 00:46:35.890
I am the head of the Cloud Knights, Signum.

00:46:36.350 --> 00:46:36.980
And you are?

00:46:37.980 --> 00:46:40.110
Fate Testarossa.

00:46:40.610 --> 00:46:42.150
Testarossa, huh?

00:46:42.770 --> 00:46:47.030
I would've been delighted to spar with you
under different circumstances.

00:46:47.030 --> 00:46:48.950
But my situation does not allow it.

00:46:49.610 --> 00:46:51.870
I can't guarantee that I won't kill you.

00:46:52.530 --> 00:46:55.450
Will you forgive my immaturity?

00:46:56.040 --> 00:46:58.620
That doesn't matter, because I'll be the one

00:46:58.620 --> 00:46:59.670
who wins!

00:47:09.840 --> 00:47:13.010
Tough bastard!
You're someone's familiar, too!

00:47:13.810 --> 00:47:19.100
You're supposed to stop your master
if they're doing something wrong!

00:47:19.100 --> 00:47:23.440
Our master knows nothing of our deeds.

00:47:24.690 --> 00:47:29.320
The four of us are taking this upon ourselves.

00:47:32.910 --> 00:47:34.080
TSAB reinforcements.

00:47:35.240 --> 00:47:38.330
An armed squad and multiple shield mages.

00:47:38.710 --> 00:47:40.460
<i>They're fast!</i>

00:47:40.460 --> 00:47:42.500
<i>They'll close in on us!</i>

00:47:43.000 --> 00:47:44.840
<i>Everyone, retreat now!</i>

00:47:45.840 --> 00:47:46.840
Fine.

00:47:47.090 --> 00:47:48.340
Understood.

00:47:50.300 --> 00:47:53.220
<i>Once I launch the flash bomb, that'll be your cue.</i>

00:48:00.140 --> 00:48:01.230
That's...

00:48:01.230 --> 00:48:03.020
Sorry, Testarossa.

00:48:05.230 --> 00:48:06.730
We'll settle this next time.

00:48:07.110 --> 00:48:08.230
Signum!

00:48:08.650 --> 00:48:12.110
I'm the Cloud Knights' Hammer Knight, Vita.

00:48:12.660 --> 00:48:15.740
I'll talk with you if you insist.

00:48:15.740 --> 00:48:18.160
But stay out of our way for now!

00:48:23.420 --> 00:48:24.630
Clear Howl.

00:48:38.260 --> 00:48:39.770
The barrier disappeared.

00:48:40.430 --> 00:48:43.520
A flash bomb's obstructing our view,
and something's jamming our signal!

00:48:43.520 --> 00:48:44.980
Track the signal!

00:48:44.980 --> 00:48:45.650
Right away!

00:48:58.700 --> 00:49:00.790
Amy, are you tracking them?

00:49:01.000 --> 00:49:03.540
Yeah, we have them marked!

00:49:03.540 --> 00:49:06.670
Sending coordinates to all tracking units!

00:49:07.090 --> 00:49:09.420
We'll find them no matter where they hide!

00:49:09.800 --> 00:49:10.760
Thanks!

00:49:14.090 --> 00:49:18.930
Chrono's after an ancient Lost Logia,
the Book of Darkness.

00:49:19.390 --> 00:49:21.390
Along with its four knights,

00:49:21.390 --> 00:49:26.900
the Book has been through multiple
owners since the ancient Belkan era.

00:49:27.900 --> 00:49:31.690
But the data I have on the Book of Darkness

00:49:31.690 --> 00:49:34.200
doesn't match those four.

00:49:34.740 --> 00:49:38.740
Fate, you were able
to talk to that swordswoman, right?

00:49:39.950 --> 00:49:42.200
She said they have a mission,

00:49:42.200 --> 00:49:43.910
for them and their master.

00:49:52.050 --> 00:49:54.090
Fate, Arf, I'm sorry.

00:49:54.470 --> 00:49:58.970
Is it okay if I put my break on hold
and go back to work?

00:49:59.390 --> 00:50:01.640
Of course it's okay.

00:50:01.640 --> 00:50:03.980
Yes, but if possible...

00:50:04.140 --> 00:50:06.850
We'd like to help out, too!

00:50:09.610 --> 00:50:10.610
Can't we?

00:50:13.320 --> 00:50:14.990
Let's all go ask.

00:50:16.030 --> 00:50:17.360
Let's!

00:50:19.160 --> 00:50:20.370
Oh, really?

00:50:22.990 --> 00:50:24.370
It's so late.

00:50:24.700 --> 00:50:27.620
Yeah, I should let you go now.

00:50:27.620 --> 00:50:28.370
Okay.

00:50:28.960 --> 00:50:31.210
I'll call you next time.

00:50:31.210 --> 00:50:32.300
Yeah.

00:50:32.300 --> 00:50:33.880
Well, good night.

00:50:33.880 --> 00:50:35.260
Good night.

00:50:39.470 --> 00:50:41.550
Welcome back, Book of Darkness.

00:50:43.140 --> 00:50:46.140
Huh? Didn't you go out with Shamal?

00:50:48.600 --> 00:50:49.690
Oh well.

00:50:50.860 --> 00:50:54.440
I prepared a hotpot for dinner,
but no one's back yet.

00:50:54.940 --> 00:50:57.450
I was chatting with Suzuka.

00:51:00.160 --> 00:51:01.070
Don't worry.

00:51:01.990 --> 00:51:05.500
Even if they're not here, we're still family,

00:51:05.500 --> 00:51:07.290
so I'm not lonely.

00:51:11.040 --> 00:51:13.090
But you know what?

00:51:13.090 --> 00:51:17.550
It's just the two of us again,
Book of Darkness, like before.

00:51:30.150 --> 00:51:32.560
Affirming activation of the Book of Darkness.

00:51:35.610 --> 00:51:41.070
We guardian knights collect pages
for the Book and protect our master.

00:51:44.410 --> 00:51:47.410
We are the clouds that gather before
the Master of the Night Sky.

00:51:48.120 --> 00:51:49.460
The Cloud Knights.

00:51:55.840 --> 00:51:56.960
<i>Hey, wait...</i>

00:51:57.340 --> 00:51:59.420
<i>Vita, shh.</i>

00:51:59.420 --> 00:52:02.970
<i>Quiet. I won't pardon rudeness before our master.</i>

00:52:03.390 --> 00:52:05.310
<i>But look...</i>

00:52:06.060 --> 00:52:07.970
<i>She passed out.</i>

00:52:10.480 --> 00:52:11.100
<i>What?</i>

00:52:11.100 --> 00:52:12.310
<i>No way!</i>

00:52:14.940 --> 00:52:16.980
Good morning.

00:52:20.030 --> 00:52:23.280
This is our first meeting.

00:52:23.280 --> 00:52:25.450
I'm the Unison Device

00:52:25.450 --> 00:52:29.000
of the Tome of the Night Sky.

00:52:31.960 --> 00:52:36.960
You are now officially our master.

00:52:36.960 --> 00:52:42.930
The Tome of the Night Sky and its four knights
will offer you wisdom and power.

00:52:42.930 --> 00:52:45.090
We are here to serve you.

00:52:45.600 --> 00:52:47.600
U-Um... Okay...

00:52:48.350 --> 00:52:51.940
There's much more I'd like to tell you.

00:52:52.520 --> 00:52:55.020
But once you wake from this slumber,

00:52:55.610 --> 00:53:00.110
you shall forget most of what I've told you.

00:53:00.820 --> 00:53:01.860
I will?

00:53:04.160 --> 00:53:07.240
Actually, this feels strange.

00:53:07.240 --> 00:53:09.790
I feel like I've met you before.

00:53:10.500 --> 00:53:12.790
In the form of this book,

00:53:13.410 --> 00:53:18.250
I've always been by your side,
ever since you were small.

00:53:18.250 --> 00:53:20.340
Oh, I see.

00:53:21.510 --> 00:53:23.300
Huh? What's this?

00:53:23.760 --> 00:53:26.140
You're waking up now.

00:53:26.720 --> 00:53:30.720
I may never be able to see you again,

00:53:30.720 --> 00:53:33.100
so may I ask something of you?

00:53:35.140 --> 00:53:37.520
Those kind knights have been

00:53:37.860 --> 00:53:40.190
fighting against their will.

00:53:41.360 --> 00:53:44.820
Please show them kindness.

00:53:45.280 --> 00:53:47.200
But most importantly,

00:53:47.870 --> 00:53:51.200
I wish for your happiness.

00:53:51.580 --> 00:53:53.580
No, wait.

00:53:54.120 --> 00:53:55.290
Wait!

00:54:05.510 --> 00:54:10.140
What a crummy town. Not a hint of magic.

00:54:10.140 --> 00:54:14.600
At least it's not a war zone or a land of bloodshed.

00:54:15.060 --> 00:54:17.730
But what of us guardian knights?

00:54:17.730 --> 00:54:20.480
We're stuck with some random master,

00:54:20.480 --> 00:54:24.360
and we have to fight to
collect the pages of the Book.

00:54:24.820 --> 00:54:27.950
That's our fate, after all.

00:54:28.450 --> 00:54:31.330
At least until we break.

00:54:31.330 --> 00:54:34.250
<i>Vita, Zafira, come back.</i>

00:54:35.120 --> 00:54:38.250
<i>Our new master has risen.</i>

00:54:38.880 --> 00:54:40.500
So...

00:54:40.500 --> 00:54:45.170
this is a magical book from an
ancient world called Belka,

00:54:45.170 --> 00:54:46.510
known as the Book of Darkness.

00:54:47.260 --> 00:54:49.300
You're its guardian knights.

00:54:49.300 --> 00:54:49.890
Yes.

00:54:50.180 --> 00:54:53.140
And I'm your master.

00:54:53.600 --> 00:54:54.470
Yes.

00:54:54.470 --> 00:54:59.400
Has the Book spoken to you before?
In your dreams, perhaps?

00:55:00.730 --> 00:55:04.110
It may have, but I'm not sure.

00:55:04.110 --> 00:55:05.150
Ah, found it!

00:55:05.990 --> 00:55:08.700
But I know one thing.

00:55:09.110 --> 00:55:15.410
As the master of the Book of Darkness,
I have to take good care of you.

00:55:17.250 --> 00:55:20.920
You can live here with me.
Plus, I'm quite the cook.

00:55:21.250 --> 00:55:23.420
That just leaves clothes!

00:55:28.800 --> 00:55:34.060
To be honest, I don't know what
I should do as your master.

00:55:34.060 --> 00:55:38.390
I just want to live in peace with all of you.

00:56:27.230 --> 00:56:28.360
Knight armor?

00:56:28.610 --> 00:56:34.820
Yes, we each have a weapon,
but we need our master to grant us armor.

00:56:35.370 --> 00:56:40.370
We'll make them ourselves,
so please come up with the design.

00:56:40.370 --> 00:56:41.580
I see.

00:56:41.960 --> 00:56:46.960
But I won't be making you guys fight, so...

00:56:47.670 --> 00:56:49.960
Can it be a knight's outfit?

00:56:50.420 --> 00:56:52.430
Yes, that will be fine.

00:57:29.340 --> 00:57:32.340
Master Hayate, are you sure about this?

00:57:32.880 --> 00:57:33.970
About what?

00:57:34.380 --> 00:57:40.140
At your request, we could collect
the pages of the Book,

00:57:40.140 --> 00:57:43.310
and you would gain immense power.

00:57:43.310 --> 00:57:45.690
Your legs would be healed, too.

00:57:47.110 --> 00:57:48.560
No can do.

00:57:48.560 --> 00:57:53.900
To collect those pages, you'd have
to inconvenience a lot of people.

00:57:54.280 --> 00:57:55.820
That's not right.

00:57:56.360 --> 00:57:59.950
I'm already happy the way I am now.

00:58:01.080 --> 00:58:06.460
My parents are with the stars,
but they left me this house and a fortune.

00:58:06.960 --> 00:58:10.840
Besides, I have all of you with me now.

00:58:14.840 --> 00:58:16.130
Hayate! Hayate!

00:58:16.590 --> 00:58:17.970
What is it, Vita?

00:58:19.180 --> 00:58:22.470
Hayate, can I have some
strawberry ice cream in the freezer?

00:58:22.850 --> 00:58:26.440
Still hungry after stuffing yourself at dinner?

00:58:26.440 --> 00:58:29.810
Shut up! I'm growing!

00:58:29.810 --> 00:58:32.110
Hayate's food is giga-yummy!

00:58:33.230 --> 00:58:35.990
Fine, then. Just a little.

00:58:36.450 --> 00:58:37.490
Got it!

00:58:39.370 --> 00:58:40.740
Signum?

00:58:40.740 --> 00:58:41.490
Yes?

00:58:41.870 --> 00:58:45.410
I don't want any power from the Book.

00:58:46.160 --> 00:58:50.420
While I am your master,
forget about collecting its pages.

00:58:51.340 --> 00:58:52.880
Will you promise me?

00:58:54.880 --> 00:58:57.300
I swear on my knight's sword.

00:59:02.010 --> 00:59:06.810
Well, Hayate, I need a few
words with Signum and Shamal.

00:59:06.930 --> 00:59:07.640
Alright.

00:59:08.230 --> 00:59:09.980
Vita, stay with Hayate.

00:59:09.980 --> 00:59:10.810
Okay.

00:59:13.570 --> 00:59:14.820
Her life's in danger?

00:59:15.230 --> 00:59:17.030
Hayate's is!?

00:59:17.030 --> 00:59:17.900
Yes.

00:59:18.530 --> 00:59:21.990
Hayate's nerve paralysis is progressing.

00:59:22.740 --> 00:59:24.790
We're doing our best,

00:59:24.790 --> 00:59:29.000
but the way it is now,
it may spread to her internal organs.

00:59:32.340 --> 00:59:35.250
<i>It wasn't an illness.</i>

00:59:36.340 --> 00:59:39.550
<i>It was a corruption in the Book's
autonomous defense program.</i>

00:59:40.640 --> 00:59:46.020
<i>The suppressed program consumed Master Hayate's
magic, eating away at her premature body.</i>

00:59:46.850 --> 00:59:49.600
<i>And our master was silently,</i>

00:59:49.600 --> 00:59:53.610
<i>but surely, being killed by the Book's curse.</i>

00:59:57.860 --> 00:59:59.150
We have to save her.

00:59:59.990 --> 01:00:01.660
We have to save Hayate!

01:00:02.160 --> 01:00:04.330
Signum, what do you say?

01:00:06.040 --> 01:00:06.660
There's...

01:00:07.750 --> 01:00:08.910
only one way.

01:00:16.170 --> 01:00:18.800
Our master's body is being devoured

01:00:18.800 --> 01:00:21.970
by the curse of the Book's
automatic defense system!

01:00:22.430 --> 01:00:27.220
If Hayate awakens as the
true master of the Book...

01:00:27.600 --> 01:00:30.430
...her affliction will vanish.

01:00:30.430 --> 01:00:32.980
At the very least, it would stop progressing.

01:00:33.440 --> 01:00:37.820
I won't kill, because I don't
want to taint Hayate's future.

01:00:37.820 --> 01:00:40.240
But I'll do anything else!

01:00:45.240 --> 01:00:47.740
Please forgive me, Master.

01:00:53.540 --> 01:00:57.130
I'll break our promise just this once!

01:01:08.430 --> 01:01:14.150
It's great that we have more support
with the Captain back, but...

01:01:14.900 --> 01:01:17.150
I'm sorry for being selfish.

01:01:17.570 --> 01:01:19.110
Sorry, Chrono.

01:01:19.110 --> 01:01:19.900
Sorry.

01:01:21.490 --> 01:01:23.280
Then, Captain, please start tomorrow.

01:01:23.950 --> 01:01:26.950
Nanoha and Fate, as provisional mages,

01:01:26.950 --> 01:01:30.040
we'll request your assistance as needed.

01:01:30.540 --> 01:01:31.160
All right.

01:01:31.160 --> 01:01:32.290
Thanks, Chrono.

01:01:39.000 --> 01:01:42.470
Hayate, I'm sorry we're so late!

01:01:53.980 --> 01:01:55.310
Master Hayate was waiting,

01:01:55.810 --> 01:01:58.810
but she's fallen asleep by now.

01:01:58.810 --> 01:01:59.690
I see.

01:02:01.730 --> 01:02:04.360
We'll apologize to her tomorrow.

01:02:04.360 --> 01:02:05.070
Yeah.

01:02:05.740 --> 01:02:07.370
By the way...

01:02:07.660 --> 01:02:09.990
what were you talking about?

01:02:11.830 --> 01:02:14.160
She asked about the Book.

01:02:14.160 --> 01:02:19.130
What we know about the Book
and what we're after.

01:02:20.710 --> 01:02:23.510
We're the Book's knights.

01:02:23.510 --> 01:02:26.260
We just collect pages for our master.

01:02:27.470 --> 01:02:28.550
That's right.

01:02:28.840 --> 01:02:32.390
But something's bothering me.

01:02:33.560 --> 01:02:35.810
Admiral Clyde Harlaown.

01:02:36.600 --> 01:02:41.770
He died 11 years ago in the last
Book of Darkness Incident.

01:02:41.770 --> 01:02:43.150
My husband.

01:02:44.940 --> 01:02:47.780
While transporting the culprit and the Book,

01:02:47.780 --> 01:02:52.540
it broke a seal created by
four mages and went berserk.

01:02:55.000 --> 01:02:58.290
To get the Book off our ship,

01:02:58.830 --> 01:03:02.630
my husband flew out on a pod
with the transport container.

01:03:11.180 --> 01:03:12.970
That was it...

01:03:14.640 --> 01:03:18.480
Um, when Admiral Clyde died, was Chrono...

01:03:19.310 --> 01:03:21.980
Chrono was three.

01:03:23.320 --> 01:03:24.980
At the funeral,

01:03:24.980 --> 01:03:27.740
he didn't cry.

01:03:29.860 --> 01:03:34.620
Nor did he blame me for not
being able to save his father.

01:03:34.910 --> 01:03:38.250
Not even once since that day.

01:03:39.210 --> 01:03:42.880
So I worry about him sometimes.

01:03:43.750 --> 01:03:49.880
But Amy, who became his friend at school,
told me something Chrono had said.

01:03:50.380 --> 01:03:54.510
"I'm proud of my mother and father
more than anyone,

01:03:54.510 --> 01:03:58.350
so I want to pursue the same career as them."

01:04:00.770 --> 01:04:04.730
Oh, my. I'm sorry.
I got a little too sentimental.

01:04:04.980 --> 01:04:06.280
No, not at all.

01:04:06.280 --> 01:04:10.360
Well, your turn.
Tell me about yourself, Fate.

01:04:10.360 --> 01:04:11.610
Alright.

01:04:11.610 --> 01:04:13.240
You told me a little before,

01:04:13.620 --> 01:04:17.700
but how are you feeling
about your mother, Presea?

01:04:19.870 --> 01:04:23.250
It's still hard to put into words.

01:04:23.710 --> 01:04:29.880
Nanoha saved me.
You and Chrono have been so kind, too.

01:04:29.880 --> 01:04:32.510
I have a new life now, but...

01:04:36.680 --> 01:04:42.270
a part of me can't move on from that day.

01:04:42.980 --> 01:04:45.020
I know that's wrong of me.

01:04:51.110 --> 01:04:54.490
That's not true. You're doing great.

01:04:54.820 --> 01:04:58.490
Let's talk more from now on, okay?

01:04:58.490 --> 01:05:00.620
About the past <i>and </i>the future.

01:05:01.370 --> 01:05:02.370
Okay.

01:05:03.170 --> 01:05:04.630
Thank you.

01:05:06.840 --> 01:05:12.470
In transformations, Bardiche and I each have three forms.

01:05:13.130 --> 01:05:16.260
Bardiche's Bullova and Crescent

01:05:16.760 --> 01:05:22.020
and my Accel and Buster Cannon are standard forms.

01:05:22.520 --> 01:05:23.390
And the third

01:05:24.230 --> 01:05:26.770
Full Drive... Excelion Mode.

01:05:27.020 --> 01:05:28.230
Exactly.

01:05:33.820 --> 01:05:35.160
Welcome back, everyone.

01:05:35.490 --> 01:05:36.200
Thanks.

01:05:36.200 --> 01:05:37.450
Yeah.

01:05:37.450 --> 01:05:40.160
You were out all night?

01:05:41.450 --> 01:05:44.920
We collected more.
We'll add it to the Book later.

01:05:44.920 --> 01:05:46.040
Okay.

01:06:04.480 --> 01:06:06.190
Hayate!

01:06:13.240 --> 01:06:14.110
Hayate...

01:06:14.990 --> 01:06:16.200
Vita?

01:06:16.820 --> 01:06:17.780
Everyone...

01:06:19.620 --> 01:06:23.200
You went into shock, but you seem stable now.

01:06:23.830 --> 01:06:27.080
Guys, you didn't need to panic.

01:06:27.080 --> 01:06:29.630
Sorry for troubling you.

01:06:29.630 --> 01:06:31.300
Hold on, Hayate.

01:06:34.170 --> 01:06:37.050
I guess I'm stuck here for a while.

01:06:37.430 --> 01:06:42.310
And that means I can't cook for you guys.

01:06:42.600 --> 01:06:44.020
Well, that's...

01:06:44.020 --> 01:06:46.980
We'll manage. Don't worry.

01:06:46.980 --> 01:06:49.310
I'll come visit every day!

01:06:49.610 --> 01:06:51.480
You're such a good girl, Vita.

01:06:52.110 --> 01:06:54.150
But don't worry about it.

01:06:57.950 --> 01:07:03.910
Shamal will stay here to take care of
and guard our master.

01:07:04.200 --> 01:07:08.830
We'll collect pages when we're not visiting.

01:07:08.830 --> 01:07:09.920
Alright.

01:07:10.920 --> 01:07:13.920
The knights' hunting grounds have expanded.

01:07:14.210 --> 01:07:16.760
They've changed their pattern.

01:07:17.260 --> 01:07:21.760
We'll contact you when we
require your assistance.

01:07:21.760 --> 01:07:22.640
Okay.

01:07:22.640 --> 01:07:23.760
Alright.

01:07:28.980 --> 01:07:35.030
<i>The pace at which the Book is devouring
Hayate seems to be increasing.</i>

01:07:35.400 --> 01:07:36.530
<i>At this rate,</i>

01:07:36.860 --> 01:07:38.240
<i>she only has a month left.</i>

01:07:39.990 --> 01:07:41.530
<i>Or maybe...</i>

01:07:42.450 --> 01:07:44.290
<i>even less than that.</i>

01:07:48.620 --> 01:07:50.210
Don't worry.

01:07:50.210 --> 01:07:51.580
We'll save her.

01:07:52.960 --> 01:07:56.340
I have no clue who added this on.

01:07:57.010 --> 01:08:00.840
I cannot free myself from this cursed chain.

01:08:01.680 --> 01:08:04.760
I'll sometimes put our master
and you all in danger,

01:08:05.350 --> 01:08:08.350
and I'll be reincarnated forever against my will.

01:08:08.930 --> 01:08:12.810
I am truly sorry.

01:08:13.480 --> 01:08:14.940
Master Hayate...

01:08:15.650 --> 01:08:20.360
I won't let you kill our kind master.

01:08:31.460 --> 01:08:32.670
<i>It doesn't hurt.</i>

01:08:33.920 --> 01:08:37.170
<i>This doesn't hurt one bit!</i>

01:08:38.050 --> 01:08:41.260
<i>Hayate must be in much more pain.</i>

01:08:45.720 --> 01:08:46.760
<i>Hayate must be</i>

01:08:47.470 --> 01:08:49.270
<i>suffering so much more!</i>

01:08:53.520 --> 01:08:56.730
<i>I don't know if Hayate will be happy</i>

01:08:56.730 --> 01:08:59.070
<i>with becoming the true master of the Book.</i>

01:09:01.360 --> 01:09:02.990
<i>She might get upset.</i>

01:09:03.660 --> 01:09:06.490
<i>She might even hate us.</i>

01:09:09.790 --> 01:09:10.660
But...

01:09:16.210 --> 01:09:19.550
to see the kind Hayate suffering like that...

01:09:19.960 --> 01:09:21.300
I can't stand it.

01:09:22.010 --> 01:09:24.050
I can't stand

01:09:24.050 --> 01:09:25.800
losing Hayate!

01:09:26.220 --> 01:09:28.140
So, Eisen!

01:09:28.260 --> 01:09:29.260
I know.

01:09:33.890 --> 01:09:35.980
Rest in pieces!

01:09:48.780 --> 01:09:51.120
Okay, here's what I've found so far.

01:09:51.700 --> 01:09:57.750
The Book of Darkness is actually called
the Tome of the Night Sky.

01:09:58.670 --> 01:10:07.010
It was created to collect and study the spells
of great mages, while traveling alongside its master.

01:10:08.220 --> 01:10:10.600
It's probably exhibiting destructive tendencies

01:10:10.600 --> 01:10:15.770
because one of its past
masters altered its program.

01:10:16.400 --> 01:10:22.780
That made its functions controlling travel
and automatic data repair go haywire.

01:10:23.490 --> 01:10:27.160
The worst part is the change
in its effect on its master.

01:10:27.660 --> 01:10:32.160
If mana isn't collected often enough,
it'll feed on that of its master.

01:10:33.200 --> 01:10:37.290
And when completed,
it'll cause untold destruction.

01:10:37.750 --> 01:10:38.830
The cause?

01:10:38.830 --> 01:10:42.420
The automatic defense system that's been added.

01:10:43.170 --> 01:10:44.300
NachtWal.

01:10:45.670 --> 01:10:50.100
That's what infects its master and
causes it to go out of control.

01:10:51.010 --> 01:10:54.270
The Book has a main Unison System,

01:10:55.310 --> 01:10:58.770
a unit called the
"Will of the Book of Darkness."

01:10:59.190 --> 01:11:03.650
But once the Book is completed,
the automatic defense system,

01:11:03.650 --> 01:11:06.900
NachtWal, soon takes over.

01:11:07.700 --> 01:11:11.070
So all the incidents so far were caused by...

01:11:11.070 --> 01:11:12.160
Probably.

01:11:12.910 --> 01:11:17.330
By using the energy it collected
and taking the life of its master,

01:11:18.170 --> 01:11:21.420
the Book will reincarnate
in search of a new master.

01:11:21.960 --> 01:11:24.670
So once they complete the Book...

01:11:24.670 --> 01:11:26.920
just like all its past masters...

01:11:28.800 --> 01:11:32.180
Anything on how to stop or seal it?

01:11:32.180 --> 01:11:34.260
Unfortunately, nothing.

01:11:34.260 --> 01:11:36.850
But I'll keep searching.

01:11:36.850 --> 01:11:37.680
Thanks.

01:11:38.140 --> 01:11:40.940
Amy, what about our last resort?

01:11:41.440 --> 01:11:46.320
The captain's working on it.
The Arthra should have it equipped already.

01:11:47.030 --> 01:11:48.320
Last resort?

01:11:49.110 --> 01:11:51.070
The anti-materiel annihilation cannon,

01:11:51.820 --> 01:11:53.030
Arc-en-ciel.

01:11:56.200 --> 01:11:58.120
Your friend's hospitalized?

01:11:58.410 --> 01:12:00.830
Yeah, suddenly last week.

01:12:00.830 --> 01:12:04.380
You mean Hayate from the library?

01:12:04.380 --> 01:12:07.340
Yeah. She'll be spending Christmas at the hospital.

01:12:08.760 --> 01:12:10.970
Then, let's go visit her.

01:12:12.010 --> 01:12:12.970
Really?

01:12:14.180 --> 01:12:15.350
You're in, right?

01:12:17.100 --> 01:12:21.230
Let's go bring her presents on Christmas Eve!

01:12:21.480 --> 01:12:23.230
Sounds good.

01:12:25.980 --> 01:12:30.320
<i>Zafira's back, so I'll switch with him.</i>

01:12:30.320 --> 01:12:31.240
Alright.

01:12:31.410 --> 01:12:36.240
<i>By the way, Hayate's friends
will be visiting her.</i>

01:12:36.450 --> 01:12:37.950
<i>Suzuka and some others.</i>

01:12:37.950 --> 01:12:38.750
<i>I see.</i>

01:12:39.250 --> 01:12:43.880
<i>Hayate got permission
to go out on Christmas Eve.</i>

01:12:44.250 --> 01:12:47.800
<i>She wants to have dinner with us.</i>

01:12:47.800 --> 01:12:49.380
<i>Sounds good.</i>

01:12:49.840 --> 01:12:52.340
<i>We'll be back by then.</i>

01:12:52.340 --> 01:12:55.390
<i>Okay. I'll check in again later.</i>

01:12:57.930 --> 01:13:01.440
Just 160 pages left...

01:13:15.450 --> 01:13:16.660
Come in!

01:13:18.620 --> 01:13:21.160
Good evening, Hayate.

01:13:21.160 --> 01:13:22.460
Good evening.

01:13:23.540 --> 01:13:24.580
Welcome!

01:13:24.880 --> 01:13:26.380
How are you feeling?

01:13:27.380 --> 01:13:30.130
I'm so bored I might pick up another disease.

01:13:32.010 --> 01:13:33.340
Let me introduce you.

01:13:33.470 --> 01:13:35.430
I'm Nanoha Takamachi.

01:13:35.430 --> 01:13:37.100
I'm Fate Testarossa.

01:13:37.390 --> 01:13:39.180
I'm Hayate Yagami.

01:13:39.180 --> 01:13:40.390
Nice to meet you.

01:13:41.350 --> 01:13:43.270
These are for you.

01:13:43.270 --> 01:13:44.900
And here's a Christmas present!

01:13:46.810 --> 01:13:49.900
We got so lost on our way here!

01:13:57.030 --> 01:13:59.330
Oh, looks like they're back.

01:13:59.330 --> 01:14:00.620
Come in!

01:14:01.120 --> 01:14:02.620
Coming in.

01:14:02.620 --> 01:14:04.000
Good evening!

01:14:04.580 --> 01:14:07.210
Suzuka, Arisa, good ev–

01:14:18.600 --> 01:14:19.930
Stop it, Vita!

01:14:20.970 --> 01:14:24.390
That's not how you should treat my guests.

01:14:24.390 --> 01:14:26.190
But, Hayate...

01:14:26.400 --> 01:14:30.570
U-Um... Nice to meet you, Vita.

01:14:30.570 --> 01:14:32.900
We mean no harm.

01:14:33.360 --> 01:14:35.650
So don't worry.

01:14:36.070 --> 01:14:37.030
Right.

01:14:37.030 --> 01:14:40.160
I'll take your coats.

01:14:40.450 --> 01:14:41.870
Enjoy.

01:14:41.870 --> 01:14:43.290
Thank you!

01:14:46.500 --> 01:14:49.540
I can't use telepathy. Are you jamming?

01:14:50.090 --> 01:14:54.420
Shamal's support skills are superb.
This is nothing for her.

01:14:58.260 --> 01:15:01.140
Um... You don't have to scowl at me like that

01:15:01.560 --> 01:15:02.890
I'm not scowling!

01:15:02.890 --> 01:15:06.140
Come on, Vita. Be a good girl.

01:15:07.140 --> 01:15:09.400
Um... Well, we...

01:15:10.270 --> 01:15:13.070
It was pure coincidence.

01:15:13.070 --> 01:15:14.990
May we chat with Hayate?

01:15:15.530 --> 01:15:16.400
Sure.

01:15:18.320 --> 01:15:19.200
See ya!

01:15:19.200 --> 01:15:20.200
Later!

01:15:29.420 --> 01:15:32.500
Hayate is the Book of Darkness's master?

01:15:33.000 --> 01:15:35.550
Our wish will soon come true.

01:15:35.550 --> 01:15:39.510
Even if you're Hayate's friends,
if you interfere...

01:15:39.510 --> 01:15:42.260
Hold on. Hear us out, too.

01:15:42.470 --> 01:15:46.520
You can't do this!
When the Book is finished, Hayate will–

01:15:52.150 --> 01:15:53.320
Nanoha!

01:15:58.530 --> 01:15:59.490
Signum!

01:15:59.700 --> 01:16:04.620
We can't have you inform
the TSAB about our master.

01:16:05.580 --> 01:16:09.920
We can't let you out of my jamming area.

01:16:13.040 --> 01:16:14.340
Vita...

01:16:15.050 --> 01:16:17.170
Don't you dare stop us.

01:16:18.970 --> 01:16:23.680
Soon, Hayate will recover and
come back to us, happy and healthy.

01:16:25.220 --> 01:16:27.100
We've tried so hard.

01:16:27.810 --> 01:16:30.520
We're so close...

01:16:31.730 --> 01:16:33.980
So stay out of our way!

01:16:56.130 --> 01:16:57.340
You devil.

01:16:58.380 --> 01:17:00.340
I'm fine with being the devil.

01:17:10.020 --> 01:17:12.850
If that's the only way you'll understand me,
I don't mind becoming the devil!

01:17:22.110 --> 01:17:24.160
Shamal, stand back.

01:17:24.610 --> 01:17:26.490
Focus on jamming.

01:17:31.500 --> 01:17:36.710
The Book is broken.
It's been corrupted.

01:17:36.710 --> 01:17:39.500
If you complete it now, Hayate will...

01:17:39.500 --> 01:17:44.220
It doesn't matter how much you
judge or criticize us.

01:17:44.220 --> 01:17:45.430
We won't listen!

01:17:45.640 --> 01:17:47.300
That's not it! It's not!

01:17:47.300 --> 01:17:49.180
I said, we won't listen!

01:17:50.310 --> 01:17:52.480
If you stand in our way,

01:18:00.400 --> 01:18:01.900
I'll cut you down!

01:18:05.110 --> 01:18:07.160
Barrier Jacket. Sonic Form.

01:18:13.960 --> 01:18:14.920
Crescent.

01:18:19.590 --> 01:18:23.010
You made your thin jacket even thinner.

01:18:23.010 --> 01:18:25.550
I can move faster this way.

01:18:25.550 --> 01:18:28.390
Even a weak blow will be fatal.

01:18:28.800 --> 01:18:30.760
It's to beat you.

01:18:32.100 --> 01:18:33.850
Had we met elsewhere,

01:18:34.270 --> 01:18:35.600
you and I may have

01:18:36.440 --> 01:18:38.610
become great friends.

01:18:39.110 --> 01:18:40.570
It's not too late!

01:18:40.570 --> 01:18:41.610
We can't stop!

01:18:42.230 --> 01:18:48.110
We'll give up our honor
to protect our master's smile!

01:18:48.490 --> 01:18:50.740
We'll give up our lives for hers!

01:18:52.950 --> 01:18:54.160
So we can't

01:18:54.750 --> 01:18:55.830
stop here!

01:18:57.080 --> 01:18:58.040
You must.

01:18:58.290 --> 01:19:00.090
Bardiche and I will stop you!

01:19:06.680 --> 01:19:08.970
<i>I can't get through to anyone.</i>

01:19:08.970 --> 01:19:10.550
<i>What's going on?</i>

01:19:38.290 --> 01:19:40.540
Restrict Lock, activated.

01:19:43.130 --> 01:19:45.090
You...

01:19:49.880 --> 01:19:52.390
Divine Buster Extension.

01:19:52.390 --> 01:19:54.760
Shoot!

01:20:11.070 --> 01:20:12.200
Book of Darkness?

01:20:20.500 --> 01:20:21.670
That's...

01:20:28.470 --> 01:20:30.630
NachtWal!? Why?

01:20:31.220 --> 01:20:32.140
No!

01:20:32.640 --> 01:20:37.640
Automatic defense system, NachtWal, activated.

01:20:37.810 --> 01:20:41.770
Wait! Not yet! We can still fight!

01:20:42.440 --> 01:20:43.520
You...

01:20:44.110 --> 01:20:46.780
That's right. It's all your...

01:20:46.980 --> 01:20:49.740
Shutting down the Guardian Knight System.

01:20:50.150 --> 01:20:53.780
Prioritizing life of the Book.

01:20:54.120 --> 01:20:56.620
Eliminating the Guardian Knight System.

01:20:57.240 --> 01:20:59.500
How dare you?

01:20:59.700 --> 01:21:02.120
How <i>dare</i> you?!

01:21:04.250 --> 01:21:05.210
Vita!

01:21:05.500 --> 01:21:10.010
Destroying enemy forces. Collecting Cores from the targets.

01:21:19.890 --> 01:21:20.770
Initiate.

01:21:32.900 --> 01:21:34.660
Shamal! Signum!

01:21:47.340 --> 01:21:49.840
Remaining Core detected.

01:21:53.930 --> 01:21:54.800
Collecting.

01:22:22.580 --> 01:22:25.790
Retrieved the Cores of the Guardian Knight System.

01:22:28.000 --> 01:22:30.250
Page collection, complete.

01:22:31.750 --> 01:22:33.720
What's going on?

01:22:33.720 --> 01:22:35.630
Who are you?

01:22:35.630 --> 01:22:37.640
It's time to rise, Master.

01:22:38.090 --> 01:22:39.220
Forget that.

01:22:40.140 --> 01:22:45.100
What did you do to them?
Give them back to me! Now!

01:22:47.400 --> 01:22:48.400
Yes, Master.

01:22:49.150 --> 01:22:52.280
Guardian Knight System has completely terminated.

01:22:52.900 --> 01:22:56.400
Returning to Master in Core Mode.

01:22:57.360 --> 01:23:00.070
No, stop! That's not what I want!

01:23:02.490 --> 01:23:03.450
No!

01:23:03.830 --> 01:23:04.910
Stop!

01:23:06.120 --> 01:23:07.290
Don't do it!

01:23:08.420 --> 01:23:10.460
Stop!

01:23:10.710 --> 01:23:11.710
Terminating.

01:23:21.800 --> 01:23:23.350
It's time to rise.

01:23:43.700 --> 01:23:45.540
Hayate!

01:24:00.510 --> 01:24:01.800
Control unit

01:24:02.390 --> 01:24:03.220
fusion.

01:24:14.900 --> 01:24:16.400
Once more...

01:24:16.400 --> 01:24:18.490
It's all ending once more...

01:24:22.570 --> 01:24:23.410
Hayate!

01:24:23.830 --> 01:24:27.660
I am the Tome of the Night Sky.
With my entire power...

01:24:28.450 --> 01:24:30.160
Diabolic Emission.

01:24:39.010 --> 01:24:40.840
I will destroy

01:24:40.840 --> 01:24:42.470
my loathsome enemies!

01:24:42.680 --> 01:24:44.050
A spatial attack!

01:24:44.800 --> 01:24:46.930
Sink into darkness.

01:24:52.060 --> 01:24:53.520
Excelion Shield.

01:25:04.030 --> 01:25:05.700
Abnormality detected!

01:25:05.700 --> 01:25:08.330
We've got visual, but no audio!

01:25:08.950 --> 01:25:10.410
But... this is...

01:25:11.120 --> 01:25:12.670
The Book of Darkness's...

01:25:13.210 --> 01:25:14.960
Unison Device.

01:25:15.290 --> 01:25:16.340
Where's Chrono?

01:25:16.340 --> 01:25:18.210
On his way already!

01:25:26.640 --> 01:25:29.140
Cease automatic defense.

01:25:29.140 --> 01:25:32.980
I will protect Master for now.

01:25:33.480 --> 01:25:34.310
Nacht...

01:25:34.940 --> 01:25:38.190
I will not blame you, a mere defense program.

01:25:38.480 --> 01:25:41.280
All responsibility lies with me.

01:25:44.780 --> 01:25:48.280
So be still if only for a while longer.

01:25:53.710 --> 01:25:56.290
Master, please rest.

01:25:56.290 --> 01:25:58.880
Please rest inside me for a while.

01:26:08.140 --> 01:26:11.270
Nanoha, I'm sorry. And thank you.

01:26:11.270 --> 01:26:14.850
Don't worry. My shield is strong.

01:26:15.770 --> 01:26:16.600
Bardiche.

01:26:16.770 --> 01:26:18.020
Lightning Form.

01:26:21.610 --> 01:26:23.490
Who is she?

01:26:24.200 --> 01:26:26.070
A Belkan Unison Device.

01:26:26.070 --> 01:26:29.990
A control unit that fuses with its master and fights.

01:26:30.540 --> 01:26:35.540
If she's out here,
Hayate's probably unconscious.

01:26:35.540 --> 01:26:37.000
How do we save her?

01:26:37.000 --> 01:26:38.840
I'm not sure, but...

01:26:39.630 --> 01:26:41.420
Let's try talking to her.

01:26:51.310 --> 01:26:53.640
Um, Book of Darkness?

01:26:54.890 --> 01:26:57.440
We are Hayate and Vita's...

01:26:57.440 --> 01:26:58.810
My knights...

01:26:59.110 --> 01:27:03.030
They swore to beat you and break Nacht's curse

01:27:03.030 --> 01:27:04.820
to save our master.

01:27:06.110 --> 01:27:11.950
My master wished that the despair
she faced be only a nightmare.

01:27:12.790 --> 01:27:15.450
I'm here to grant her that wish.

01:27:16.000 --> 01:27:21.170
I just want my master to find
an eternal and peaceful rest.

01:27:22.300 --> 01:27:25.970
As for those who stand in our way,

01:27:26.340 --> 01:27:28.340
eternal darkness awaits!

01:27:46.030 --> 01:27:47.200
Nanoha!

01:27:56.120 --> 01:27:58.120
Crescent Saber!

01:28:09.800 --> 01:28:11.180
Combination 2,

01:28:11.180 --> 01:28:12.680
Buster Shift!

01:28:13.140 --> 01:28:13.850
Lock!

01:28:18.640 --> 01:28:20.270
Shoot!

01:28:30.150 --> 01:28:31.660
Penetrate.

01:28:48.880 --> 01:28:49.550
These are...

01:28:49.550 --> 01:28:51.010
...<i>our</i> spells!

01:28:51.930 --> 01:28:56.140
The spells my knights collected
at the cost of their lives.

01:28:57.930 --> 01:28:59.140
Book of Darkness?

01:28:59.640 --> 01:29:03.480
I understand that this isn't your fault.

01:29:03.770 --> 01:29:06.860
But if you two had not interfered,

01:29:06.860 --> 01:29:11.570
my knights and master would've been able
to spend this holy night in peace.

01:29:12.820 --> 01:29:17.580
They would've been able to spend
our master's remaining days in peace.

01:29:18.040 --> 01:29:21.410
Hayate's still alive. So are your knights!

01:29:21.410 --> 01:29:23.170
It's too late.

01:29:23.170 --> 01:29:27.920
The fate of the master of the Book is sealed.

01:29:28.130 --> 01:29:29.210
It's not over yet!

01:29:29.210 --> 01:29:30.760
We won't let it end like this!

01:29:38.510 --> 01:29:41.140
You're crying because you're sad!

01:29:41.140 --> 01:29:43.520
Because you don't want to give up!

01:29:43.520 --> 01:29:48.270
If not, it doesn't make sense!
If you've given up already,

01:29:48.270 --> 01:29:50.650
you wouldn't be crying!

01:29:57.990 --> 01:29:59.830
Barrier Jacket, purge!

01:30:04.330 --> 01:30:07.380
We'll keep telling you until you get it.

01:30:07.630 --> 01:30:11.630
We want to save you. And Hayate, too!

01:30:32.990 --> 01:30:34.490
So soon.

01:30:34.490 --> 01:30:37.110
The destruction has already begun.

01:30:37.110 --> 01:30:39.740
My consciousness will soon fade.

01:30:40.280 --> 01:30:43.580
Then Nacht will begin to rampage.

01:30:43.750 --> 01:30:48.830
But before I go, I shall grant the
wishes of my master and her knights.

01:30:51.090 --> 01:30:52.090
Sleep.

01:30:53.050 --> 01:30:53.840
You brat!

01:30:54.470 --> 01:30:55.340
Sonic Drive.

01:31:07.100 --> 01:31:09.520
You seem to have some darkness in your heart.

01:31:13.690 --> 01:31:14.900
Fate?!

01:31:22.030 --> 01:31:23.290
Absorption.

01:31:24.200 --> 01:31:25.540
Fate!

01:31:26.250 --> 01:31:33.300
My master and that girl shall lie in an
endless dream, never to rise again.

01:31:34.380 --> 01:31:36.760
A dream between life and death.

01:31:36.760 --> 01:31:38.510
<i>That</i> is eternity.

01:31:40.140 --> 01:31:41.930
Eternity...

01:31:41.930 --> 01:31:42.930
doesn't exist!

01:31:58.820 --> 01:32:00.450
This is...

01:32:09.750 --> 01:32:13.420
Fate, Alicia, Arf, rise and shine.

01:32:15.460 --> 01:32:16.920
This can't be.

01:32:18.970 --> 01:32:20.840
Good morning, Fate.

01:32:21.470 --> 01:32:23.680
Are you all up yet?

01:32:24.140 --> 01:32:25.180
I am!

01:32:26.430 --> 01:32:28.140
I'm sleepy.

01:32:28.140 --> 01:32:31.060
You two were up late, I bet.

01:32:31.060 --> 01:32:32.560
Just a little.

01:32:32.560 --> 01:32:33.860
Right?

01:32:33.860 --> 01:32:37.320
Be more like Fate.
Early to bed, early to rise.

01:32:37.320 --> 01:32:39.530
You're her big sister, Alicia.

01:32:40.610 --> 01:32:42.530
Um... Rynith?

01:32:43.200 --> 01:32:43.910
Yes?

01:32:44.370 --> 01:32:46.290
What is it, Fate?

01:32:46.290 --> 01:32:48.000
Alicia?

01:32:48.000 --> 01:32:49.080
Yep.

01:32:50.750 --> 01:32:52.960
Bardiche! Where's Bardiche?

01:32:53.960 --> 01:32:55.210
What's that?

01:32:55.210 --> 01:32:57.130
What? It's my...

01:32:58.050 --> 01:33:02.090
I may have spoken too soon.
Fate's a sleepyhead today.

01:33:03.390 --> 01:33:05.850
Get changed and have breakfast.

01:33:05.850 --> 01:33:09.100
Presea is waiting at the garden table already.

01:33:09.640 --> 01:33:10.890
Okay!

01:33:12.020 --> 01:33:13.400
Mother...

01:33:22.990 --> 01:33:24.570
Good morning, Mommy!

01:33:24.570 --> 01:33:25.320
Good morning.

01:33:25.320 --> 01:33:26.410
Good morning!

01:33:26.830 --> 01:33:28.660
Good morning, Arf.

01:33:28.660 --> 01:33:33.120
Presea, did you hear that we might
get a storm tomorrow?

01:33:34.750 --> 01:33:36.130
What's wrong, Fate?

01:33:37.630 --> 01:33:40.630
She must've had a scary dream.

01:33:41.220 --> 01:33:44.720
She thinks this is a dream or an illusion.

01:33:44.720 --> 01:33:46.260
Studying too much?

01:33:46.390 --> 01:33:47.760
That's possible.

01:33:48.510 --> 01:33:50.020
Fate, come here.

01:34:04.660 --> 01:34:06.410
Did you have a scary dream?

01:34:07.120 --> 01:34:08.740
Don't worry.

01:34:08.740 --> 01:34:09.660
Your mother,

01:34:09.660 --> 01:34:14.000
Alicia... Rynith, we're all here with you.

01:34:14.000 --> 01:34:16.130
Presea, me too!

01:34:16.130 --> 01:34:17.670
Yes, Arf too!

01:34:17.920 --> 01:34:22.170
She should forget all about her
bad dream over breakfast.

01:34:22.670 --> 01:34:25.470
Come on, sit down. Let's eat.

01:34:35.480 --> 01:34:36.810
<i>No...</i>

01:34:36.810 --> 01:34:38.610
<i>This is a dream.</i>

01:34:39.110 --> 01:34:45.070
<i>Mother never smiled at me like that.</i>

01:34:45.570 --> 01:34:49.580
<i>Alicia and Rynith are both gone now, too.</i>

01:34:50.870 --> 01:34:51.740
<i>But...</i>

01:34:52.540 --> 01:34:53.830
<i>This is...</i>

01:34:54.290 --> 01:34:57.500
Hey, how about we all go into town today?

01:34:58.290 --> 01:34:59.630
That sounds good.

01:34:59.630 --> 01:35:03.210
We should buy Fate new clothes.

01:35:04.170 --> 01:35:06.550
Only Fate again? That's no fair!

01:35:07.260 --> 01:35:10.470
It's her reward for getting a
perfect score on her magic test.

01:35:10.470 --> 01:35:12.470
You need to try a bit harder, Alicia.

01:35:12.470 --> 01:35:13.220
That's right!

01:35:16.640 --> 01:35:17.690
Fate!

01:35:21.270 --> 01:35:24.610
Tutor me for the next test, please!

01:35:25.650 --> 01:35:26.360
Sure.

01:35:33.120 --> 01:35:34.240
Fate?

01:35:36.620 --> 01:35:38.330
<i>This is what...</i>

01:35:38.670 --> 01:35:40.170
<i>I've always wanted.</i>

01:35:43.210 --> 01:35:45.420
<i>What I've dreamed for...</i>

01:35:45.420 --> 01:35:46.880
<i>over and over.</i>

01:35:46.880 --> 01:35:48.340
What's wrong, Fate?

01:35:48.340 --> 01:35:50.050
Are you all right?

01:35:50.050 --> 01:35:51.600
Fate?

01:35:54.390 --> 01:35:55.560
I'm so sleepy.

01:35:56.850 --> 01:35:59.140
Just go to sleep,

01:35:59.140 --> 01:36:00.480
my master...

01:36:04.900 --> 01:36:08.740
I will grant all of your wishes.

01:36:49.030 --> 01:36:50.860
Nacht, penetrate.

01:37:11.380 --> 01:37:13.840
<i>Only three magazines left,</i>

01:37:13.840 --> 01:37:16.100
<i>and 18 cartridges left in this one.</i>

01:37:16.310 --> 01:37:17.390
Reload.

01:37:18.220 --> 01:37:20.640
<i>I need a killer shot.</i>

01:37:21.640 --> 01:37:24.310
Let's go, Raising Heart.

01:37:24.400 --> 01:37:26.060
Let us go, Master.

01:37:32.200 --> 01:37:33.820
What did I...

01:37:33.820 --> 01:37:36.780
What did I wish for?

01:37:36.780 --> 01:37:38.950
I will take this depressing reality

01:37:38.950 --> 01:37:41.330
and erase it for you.

01:37:52.510 --> 01:37:53.930
Why don't you

01:37:53.930 --> 01:37:55.050
go to sleep?

01:37:56.970 --> 01:37:58.430
I will sooner or later.

01:37:58.760 --> 01:38:01.180
But not right now.

01:38:04.980 --> 01:38:07.980
Raising Heart, Excelion Mode.

01:38:09.270 --> 01:38:10.280
Drive!

01:38:10.280 --> 01:38:11.320
Ignition!

01:38:21.830 --> 01:38:24.460
All the sorrow and all the bad dreams...

01:38:24.460 --> 01:38:26.210
I'll put an end to them all!

01:38:30.630 --> 01:38:33.130
Photon Lancer Genocide Shift.

01:38:55.200 --> 01:38:55.650
Huh?

01:39:00.160 --> 01:39:01.490
Fate, let's go home.

01:39:03.040 --> 01:39:04.290
Fate?

01:39:04.910 --> 01:39:08.500
Sorry, Alicia.
I'd like to stay here a little longer.

01:39:09.290 --> 01:39:12.000
You will? Then I'll keep you company.

01:39:12.420 --> 01:39:15.970
We'll take cover from the rain together here.

01:39:24.930 --> 01:39:26.730
Hey, Alicia.

01:39:26.940 --> 01:39:29.190
This is a dream, right?

01:39:30.810 --> 01:39:33.440
Don't be silly, Fate.

01:39:33.440 --> 01:39:35.900
Of course it's not a dream.

01:39:39.820 --> 01:39:43.660
You and I can't exist at the same time.

01:39:43.660 --> 01:39:47.250
If you were still alive,
I'd never have been born.

01:39:50.130 --> 01:39:53.500
And Mother never...

01:39:54.250 --> 01:39:56.170
She was a kind person,

01:39:56.170 --> 01:39:59.430
but she tried a little too hard...

01:40:00.550 --> 01:40:04.010
to resurrect me from the dead.

01:40:05.520 --> 01:40:06.520
I know.

01:40:07.770 --> 01:40:10.520
Fate, who cares if it's a dream?

01:40:10.850 --> 01:40:13.770
Stay here with us, forever.

01:40:14.400 --> 01:40:18.530
I'll be your big sister forever if you stay here.

01:40:19.610 --> 01:40:20.780
Mommy and Rynith, too...

01:40:21.320 --> 01:40:24.280
they'll give you lots of love.

01:40:24.530 --> 01:40:28.290
We can do a lot of fun things as a family.

01:40:30.120 --> 01:40:32.210
The happiness you wanted...

01:40:32.420 --> 01:40:34.960
We can give it to you, Fate.

01:40:36.420 --> 01:40:40.090
The happiness I wanted...

01:40:40.090 --> 01:40:41.930
A healthy body.

01:40:41.930 --> 01:40:44.100
Peaceful days with your loved ones.

01:40:44.430 --> 01:40:46.310
Sleep now.

01:40:46.310 --> 01:40:51.770
And you'll be granted all of that in your dreams.

01:40:52.730 --> 01:40:55.190
No one will hurt you.

01:40:55.190 --> 01:40:58.860
A world without pain or sorrow.

01:41:00.070 --> 01:41:03.240
That'd be nice.

01:41:28.350 --> 01:41:30.480
Your attacks are getting stale.

01:41:30.480 --> 01:41:31.980
As if I'd fall for that.

01:41:32.270 --> 01:41:33.310
I'll show you!

01:41:35.940 --> 01:41:38.190
A.C.S. Standby.

01:41:42.200 --> 01:41:44.990
Raising Heart is giving me the power

01:41:44.990 --> 01:41:47.200
to save the girls in tears!

01:41:47.410 --> 01:41:48.870
Strike Flame.

01:41:53.580 --> 01:41:56.670
Excelion Buster, A.C.S.!

01:41:56.670 --> 01:41:58.170
Drive!

01:42:31.620 --> 01:42:32.500
Reach her!

01:42:37.880 --> 01:42:38.920
Break...

01:42:43.420 --> 01:42:44.550
No way!

01:42:44.550 --> 01:42:45.800
Shoot!

01:42:59.900 --> 01:43:01.020
<i>Basically point-blank...</i>

01:43:01.690 --> 01:43:04.070
<i>I penetrated her barrier and got a direct hit.</i>

01:43:04.490 --> 01:43:05.900
<i>If that didn't work...</i>

01:43:05.900 --> 01:43:07.030
Master.

01:43:16.330 --> 01:43:18.630
Guess we'll have to try a bit harder.

01:43:18.880 --> 01:43:20.130
Yes.

01:43:26.010 --> 01:43:27.090
Right...

01:43:29.090 --> 01:43:30.930
I still...

01:43:39.100 --> 01:43:39.900
Thank you.

01:43:40.400 --> 01:43:41.360
Alicia.

01:43:42.110 --> 01:43:42.900
Sorry.

01:43:43.530 --> 01:43:44.400
But I...

01:43:45.530 --> 01:43:47.030
I have to go.

01:43:54.790 --> 01:43:56.870
I should be the one apologizing.

01:44:01.040 --> 01:44:02.670
I actually knew.

01:44:03.420 --> 01:44:06.010
But even for a little while... Even in a dream...

01:44:06.460 --> 01:44:07.670
I wanted to be with you.

01:44:17.980 --> 01:44:18.810
I'm sorry.

01:44:19.770 --> 01:44:21.730
I'm so sorry, Alicia.

01:44:22.190 --> 01:44:23.060
It's fine.

01:44:23.820 --> 01:44:26.070
I'm your big sister, Fate.

01:44:26.740 --> 01:44:31.870
You need to go back to your
friends and loved ones.

01:44:31.870 --> 01:44:32.570
Yeah.

01:44:33.330 --> 01:44:36.330
Then go back to them, Fate.

01:44:37.290 --> 01:44:38.250
Thank you.

01:44:39.120 --> 01:44:40.170
Alicia.

01:44:41.120 --> 01:44:42.460
I love you.

01:44:46.210 --> 01:44:47.300
Me too.

01:44:48.300 --> 01:44:49.470
I love you.

01:44:49.970 --> 01:44:51.090
Fate.

01:44:51.590 --> 01:44:53.010
Forever and ever.

01:44:53.550 --> 01:44:54.760
Take care.

01:45:06.070 --> 01:45:09.610
<i>I wanted this in real life, too.</i>

01:45:30.800 --> 01:45:32.430
If you...

01:45:32.430 --> 01:45:33.760
If you guys weren't here!

01:45:41.480 --> 01:45:42.940
Let's go, Bardiche.

01:45:43.140 --> 01:45:44.060
Yes, sir.

01:45:52.070 --> 01:45:53.530
Zanber Form.

01:46:02.250 --> 01:46:03.160
Mother...

01:46:03.790 --> 01:46:04.710
Rynith...

01:46:05.630 --> 01:46:06.840
Alicia...

01:46:10.050 --> 01:46:11.420
I'm glad I saw you.

01:46:19.970 --> 01:46:21.470
I'm off.

01:46:21.470 --> 01:46:24.390
To the place I'm needed now!

01:46:26.730 --> 01:46:28.150
Hurricane Thunderclap!

01:47:25.120 --> 01:47:25.870
Sleep!

01:48:14.340 --> 01:48:15.960
I remember now.

01:48:15.960 --> 01:48:17.510
I remember it all.

01:48:18.010 --> 01:48:21.590
I remember why all this happened.

01:48:22.470 --> 01:48:23.220
I'm begging you.

01:48:23.760 --> 01:48:27.310
Please go back to sleep, Master!

01:48:27.810 --> 01:48:31.730
In mere minutes, with my own curse,

01:48:31.980 --> 01:48:34.480
I will kill you.

01:48:34.610 --> 01:48:39.400
So I at least wanted you to
find peace, in your dreams.

01:48:41.820 --> 01:48:44.780
I know you're only thinking about me,

01:48:44.780 --> 01:48:48.040
but I can't accept that.

01:48:49.660 --> 01:48:52.330
We're alike, you and I.

01:48:53.080 --> 01:48:57.130
We were both so lonely, so sad.

01:48:57.130 --> 01:48:59.760
Powerless as individuals.

01:49:01.630 --> 01:49:04.390
But I can't forget any of that.

01:49:05.640 --> 01:49:08.850
I'm your current master,

01:49:08.850 --> 01:49:12.020
and you're my dear child.

01:49:12.810 --> 01:49:16.400
But Nacht won't stop!

01:49:16.400 --> 01:49:18.610
It can't be controlled!

01:49:21.700 --> 01:49:22.780
Stop now!

01:49:31.160 --> 01:49:35.000
Whoever's fighting out there, I need your help!

01:49:35.790 --> 01:49:37.000
Hayate?

01:49:37.000 --> 01:49:39.960
The black thing coiling around her...

01:49:44.050 --> 01:49:45.640
Nanoha! Fate!

01:49:45.640 --> 01:49:46.720
Yuuno!

01:49:46.720 --> 01:49:48.140
Fate, can you hear me?

01:49:48.680 --> 01:49:49.640
Arf!

01:49:50.850 --> 01:49:53.560
While the master is conscious in a fusion,

01:49:54.310 --> 01:49:58.480
we may be able to detach
the defense system from it.

01:49:58.480 --> 01:49:59.530
Really?

01:49:59.530 --> 01:50:00.440
But how?

01:50:00.650 --> 01:50:02.240
How do we do that?

01:50:02.240 --> 01:50:04.450
Your pure magic cannons.

01:50:04.450 --> 01:50:06.700
Blast it away!

01:50:06.950 --> 01:50:09.200
All of your power!
Don't hold back!

01:50:12.830 --> 01:50:14.460
Got it, Yuuno!

01:50:14.460 --> 01:50:15.420
Loud and clear!

01:50:15.460 --> 01:50:16.540
Indeed.

01:50:19.800 --> 01:50:21.340
I'll give you a name.

01:50:21.340 --> 01:50:26.800
I won't let anyone call you the
"Book of Darkness" or the "Cursed Tome."

01:50:26.800 --> 01:50:28.220
I won't let them.

01:50:30.600 --> 01:50:32.310
I have a perfect name for you.

01:50:33.140 --> 01:50:35.270
For one so strong and supportive.

01:50:35.270 --> 01:50:38.440
The blessed wind who protects us all.

01:50:39.650 --> 01:50:41.440
Reinforce.

01:50:52.950 --> 01:50:56.960
N&F, mid-range extermination combination!

01:50:56.960 --> 01:50:58.590
Blast Calamity!

01:51:02.880 --> 01:51:04.420
Fire!

01:51:25.900 --> 01:51:29.370
Detachment of the defense program confirmed.

01:51:29.740 --> 01:51:31.120
Great!

01:51:31.620 --> 01:51:32.990
It's not over yet.

01:51:33.410 --> 01:51:35.750
Arc-en-ciel, standby!

01:51:36.000 --> 01:51:36.830
Yes, ma'am!

01:51:48.380 --> 01:51:51.140
Durandal, lend me your power.

01:51:52.100 --> 01:51:57.520
The Tome of the Night Sky
and its Unison Device, Reinforce.

01:51:57.770 --> 01:52:01.060
I'll protect you with my life.

01:52:01.610 --> 01:52:02.570
But...

01:52:03.980 --> 01:52:06.780
NachtWal cannot be stopped.

01:52:06.780 --> 01:52:10.870
The immense energy that's been
separated will quickly wreak havoc.

01:52:12.450 --> 01:52:13.910
We'll deal with it.

01:52:18.670 --> 01:52:19.790
Let's go.

01:52:20.460 --> 01:52:21.540
Reinforce.

01:52:24.300 --> 01:52:26.960
Yes, Master.

01:52:45.900 --> 01:52:48.030
Administrator powers, initiated.

01:52:49.280 --> 01:52:51.280
Linker Cores, reactivated.

01:52:51.450 --> 01:52:54.280
Guardian Knight System, recovered.

01:52:57.410 --> 01:52:58.290
Come to me,

01:52:58.790 --> 01:53:00.290
my knights.

01:53:46.210 --> 01:53:47.210
Hayate!

01:53:53.090 --> 01:53:55.220
Bless the light of the night sky!

01:53:55.760 --> 01:53:58.510
Reinforce, Unison in!

01:54:52.190 --> 01:54:53.110
Hayate...

01:54:54.780 --> 01:54:56.070
I'm sorry.

01:54:56.490 --> 01:54:59.830
Um... Hayate, we...

01:55:00.200 --> 01:55:02.750
It's okay. I know all about it.

01:55:03.200 --> 01:55:05.120
Reinforce told me.

01:55:07.170 --> 01:55:09.500
We'll talk more later.

01:55:10.000 --> 01:55:11.840
But for now...

01:55:12.340 --> 01:55:14.840
Welcome back, everyone.

01:55:21.850 --> 01:55:24.270
Hayate! Hayate!

01:55:33.280 --> 01:55:35.990
Sorry to ruin the mood, but...

01:55:36.900 --> 01:55:40.580
I am Enforcer Chrono Harlaown of the TSAB.

01:55:40.830 --> 01:55:45.870
We don't have much time, so I'll keep
this brief. It's about that black mass.

01:55:46.410 --> 01:55:51.630
That's the Book's defense system
that will soon go out of control.

01:55:52.040 --> 01:55:53.500
Is that correct?

01:55:53.500 --> 01:55:57.840
Yes. That's the automatic
defense system, NachtWal.

01:55:57.840 --> 01:56:02.510
Nacht will swallow everything
around itself and keep growing.

01:56:03.390 --> 01:56:08.770
Unless it reaches its limit,
it could swallow this planet whole.

01:56:10.730 --> 01:56:12.360
I have a plan to shut it down.

01:56:12.770 --> 01:56:16.900
I wish I could say "we'll take care of it," but...

01:56:25.950 --> 01:56:27.960
We need all the help we can get.

01:56:28.250 --> 01:56:32.210
The knights must end the curse of the Book.

01:56:32.340 --> 01:56:36.710
Nanoha and Fate must protect
this city and this world.

01:56:37.590 --> 01:56:39.130
Will you cooperate?

01:56:39.430 --> 01:56:40.220
Yes.

01:56:44.560 --> 01:56:45.310
Yeah!

01:56:53.610 --> 01:56:57.490
First, breach Nacht's multiple defenses.

01:56:57.490 --> 01:57:00.610
Next, damage its body and expose its Core.

01:57:00.610 --> 01:57:06.540
Then, with Yuuno's teleportation magic,
send it in front of the Arthra!

01:57:06.830 --> 01:57:10.000
We'll obliterate it with the
Arc-en-ciel, and it'll be finished!

01:57:11.960 --> 01:57:14.090
Arc-en-ciel, begin charging!

01:57:14.500 --> 01:57:15.670
Yes, ma'am!

01:57:19.760 --> 01:57:21.760
Nanoha, Fate.

01:57:21.760 --> 01:57:22.430
Shamal.

01:57:23.010 --> 01:57:23.800
Yes?

01:57:25.550 --> 01:57:27.010
Shall I treat them?

01:57:28.100 --> 01:57:29.350
Klarwind.

01:57:30.100 --> 01:57:31.310
Show them your power.

01:57:31.520 --> 01:57:31.980
Yes.

01:57:33.230 --> 01:57:36.690
Dear zephyr, carry the blessing of healing.

01:57:50.750 --> 01:57:54.250
Lady of the Lake Shamal and
the Ring of Breezes Klarwind.

01:57:54.790 --> 01:57:57.250
Healing and support is our specialty.

01:57:57.920 --> 01:57:59.300
Amazing!

01:57:59.300 --> 01:58:01.050
Thank you so much!

01:58:04.340 --> 01:58:07.930
We'll provide support until thes Core is exposed.

01:58:07.930 --> 01:58:09.390
Let's pin it down.

01:58:09.390 --> 01:58:10.140
Yeah!

01:58:10.140 --> 01:58:11.100
Got it.

01:58:15.150 --> 01:58:16.310
It's begun.

01:58:18.940 --> 01:58:23.110
The program that gave rise to the name
"Cursed Book of Darkness..."

01:58:23.110 --> 01:58:26.070
NachtWal's corrupted destructive form.

01:58:26.570 --> 01:58:28.070
The Book of Darkness's...

01:58:28.070 --> 01:58:28.870
darkness itself...

01:58:40.880 --> 01:58:42.380
Caging Circle!

01:58:42.880 --> 01:58:44.130
Chain Bind!

01:58:51.390 --> 01:58:54.020
Chain it, Steel Yoke!

01:59:20.080 --> 01:59:21.540
Forward team, heading in!

01:59:21.540 --> 01:59:23.880
Nanoha, Vita! I'll leave it to you!

01:59:23.880 --> 01:59:24.800
Alright!

01:59:25.510 --> 01:59:28.180
Back me up, Nanoha Takamachi.

01:59:29.590 --> 01:59:30.760
Sure!

01:59:30.850 --> 01:59:32.760
Let's go, Eisen!

01:59:34.390 --> 01:59:35.640
Giant.

01:59:42.440 --> 01:59:44.780
Accel Shooter, Vanishing Shift!

01:59:46.400 --> 01:59:47.860
Lock on.

01:59:49.610 --> 01:59:51.820
Shoot!

02:00:08.510 --> 02:00:10.130
Thundering

02:00:10.130 --> 02:00:12.010
Explosion!

02:00:17.100 --> 02:00:18.520
Giant

02:00:18.520 --> 02:00:20.980
Blow!

02:00:27.070 --> 02:00:28.780
Signum, Fate!

02:00:36.490 --> 02:00:38.160
Let's go, Testarossa.

02:00:38.160 --> 02:00:39.660
Yes, Signum.

02:00:51.970 --> 02:00:53.340
Bow form!

02:01:04.190 --> 02:01:06.070
Fly, Falcon!

02:01:06.650 --> 02:01:08.030
Storm Falcon!

02:01:09.150 --> 02:01:11.240
Break through, Thunder God!

02:01:11.400 --> 02:01:12.860
Jet Zanber.

02:01:33.550 --> 02:01:34.590
Did that do it?

02:01:37.140 --> 02:01:38.060
Not quite!

02:02:00.080 --> 02:02:00.790
Hayate!

02:02:01.620 --> 02:02:04.620
Rise from beyond, branches of mistletoe.

02:02:04.620 --> 02:02:07.330
Become spears of the silver
moon and break through!

02:02:14.550 --> 02:02:15.930
Petrifying spears...

02:02:15.930 --> 02:02:16.800
Mistilteinn!

02:02:40.410 --> 02:02:42.330
Chrono, finish it!

02:02:49.880 --> 02:02:51.090
Freeze!

02:02:51.590 --> 02:02:53.010
Eternal Coffin.

02:03:06.730 --> 02:03:08.900
Nanoha, Fate, Hayate!

02:03:09.980 --> 02:03:11.980
Starlight Breaker.

02:03:15.110 --> 02:03:16.610
Full power, full throttle!

02:03:16.610 --> 02:03:18.410
Starlight...

02:03:18.740 --> 02:03:20.240
Plasma Zanber.

02:03:23.290 --> 02:03:24.290
Flash of Lightning...

02:03:24.950 --> 02:03:26.540
Plasma Zanber!

02:03:28.790 --> 02:03:29.920
Sorry.

02:03:30.790 --> 02:03:32.040
Rest in peace.

02:03:34.050 --> 02:03:36.920
Sound the Horn of Judgment, Ragnarök!

02:03:39.890 --> 02:03:43.600
Breaker!

02:04:11.630 --> 02:04:12.500
And...

02:04:12.840 --> 02:04:13.630
got you!

02:04:14.880 --> 02:04:16.090
Long-distance teleport!

02:04:16.210 --> 02:04:17.840
Target, on track!

02:04:18.840 --> 02:04:19.590
Teleport!

02:04:24.850 --> 02:04:26.890
Core is en route!

02:04:26.890 --> 02:04:29.940
It's repairing itself as it's being teleported!

02:04:29.940 --> 02:04:30.940
I-It's fast!

02:04:36.480 --> 02:04:38.900
Arc-en-ciel, barrel ready!

02:04:42.610 --> 02:04:44.620
Firing lock system...

02:04:44.620 --> 02:04:45.530
open!

02:04:57.170 --> 02:04:58.380
Arc-en-ciel...

02:04:58.670 --> 02:04:59.630
Fire!

02:05:33.080 --> 02:05:36.380
Target completely terminated!

02:05:36.670 --> 02:05:37.960
Regenerative signature...

02:05:38.710 --> 02:05:40.050
not detected!

02:05:41.720 --> 02:05:46.800
Stay alert. Let's monitor the area for a while.

02:05:46.800 --> 02:05:47.970
Roger that!

02:05:53.480 --> 02:05:55.480
Mission complete.

02:06:02.150 --> 02:06:03.860
Thanks for your help.

02:06:28.510 --> 02:06:29.810
Master?

02:06:29.810 --> 02:06:31.930
Please maintain the fusion.

02:06:32.310 --> 02:06:33.930
Master!

02:06:34.690 --> 02:06:35.440
Hayate!

02:06:36.270 --> 02:06:37.400
Hayate!

02:06:42.440 --> 02:06:43.400
Hayate!

02:06:43.610 --> 02:06:44.740
Hayate...

02:06:44.740 --> 02:06:45.740
Hayate!

02:07:06.800 --> 02:07:07.630
The damage I...

02:07:08.220 --> 02:07:11.220
The damage the Book inflicted is severe.

02:07:11.850 --> 02:07:16.390
Nacht has been stopped,
but its twisted base remains.

02:07:16.390 --> 02:07:19.940
I, the Tome of the Night Sky,

02:07:19.940 --> 02:07:24.900
will invariably create a new NachtWal,
paving the way for destruction once more.

02:07:25.940 --> 02:07:28.740
What'll happen to Master Hayate?

02:07:29.200 --> 02:07:31.240
There's nothing to worry about.

02:07:31.240 --> 02:07:35.330
Nacht's corruption has stopped,
and her Linker Core is stable.

02:07:36.120 --> 02:07:39.370
Her legs will heal with time.

02:07:39.960 --> 02:07:42.750
Her first mission was so demanding.

02:07:42.750 --> 02:07:45.260
She just needs some rest.

02:07:45.510 --> 02:07:49.260
Oh. She's going to make
a full recovery, then?

02:07:49.260 --> 02:07:51.760
Well, we have no regrets.

02:07:52.010 --> 02:07:57.480
Now that Nacht's been stopped,
the Book can easily be destroyed.

02:07:57.480 --> 02:08:01.690
If it's destroyed,
it can't hurt anyone ever again.

02:08:02.440 --> 02:08:05.530
Although, we'll disappear with it.

02:08:06.150 --> 02:08:07.280
Vita...

02:08:07.280 --> 02:08:08.820
That's fine.

02:08:09.490 --> 02:08:14.240
We all knew this was a possibility.

02:08:14.240 --> 02:08:15.910
That's not quite right.

02:08:16.250 --> 02:08:17.830
You four will remain.

02:08:18.370 --> 02:08:20.170
Only I will disappear.

02:08:22.960 --> 02:08:25.210
Destroy the Tome of the Night Sky?

02:08:26.210 --> 02:08:27.050
Why?

02:08:27.510 --> 02:08:30.550
But we destroyed the defense program!

02:08:30.550 --> 02:08:33.600
NachtWal has been destroyed,

02:08:33.600 --> 02:08:37.850
but the Tome will soon reactivate the program.

02:08:37.850 --> 02:08:42.690
Hayate and the knights might be
the ones possessed next time.

02:08:43.270 --> 02:08:47.940
The threat remains so long as the Tome exists.

02:08:48.190 --> 02:08:53.070
So Reinforce has suggested
that we destroy her while we can.

02:08:54.370 --> 02:08:55.530
But that's...

02:08:56.120 --> 02:08:59.250
Then Signum and the knights will...

02:08:59.750 --> 02:09:02.710
No, we will remain.

02:09:03.750 --> 02:09:05.210
Just like NachtWal,

02:09:05.210 --> 02:09:09.210
we've been freed from the Book.

02:09:09.670 --> 02:09:14.720
We came to tell you Reinforce's last request.

02:09:15.300 --> 02:09:16.600
A request?

02:09:19.310 --> 02:09:24.480
General, I've known you
for such a long time now,

02:09:25.230 --> 02:09:28.030
but we've never spoken like this.

02:09:28.820 --> 02:09:29.780
Indeed.

02:09:38.790 --> 02:09:39.700
Sorry.

02:09:40.160 --> 02:09:41.540
I'm at a loss for words.

02:09:41.540 --> 02:09:43.040
Don't apologize.

02:09:43.040 --> 02:09:44.420
Stand proud with your chin up.

02:09:46.340 --> 02:09:48.630
Take good care...

02:09:48.630 --> 02:09:49.880
of our master.

02:09:51.260 --> 02:09:52.260
We will.

02:09:56.350 --> 02:09:57.720
Thanks for coming.

02:10:02.390 --> 02:10:04.730
Reinforce?

02:10:05.690 --> 02:10:07.360
You would call me that?

02:10:07.810 --> 02:10:08.570
Yeah.

02:10:09.230 --> 02:10:12.440
Don't you want someone else
to send you back to the sky?

02:10:13.070 --> 02:10:15.740
No, I want you to.

02:10:15.740 --> 02:10:19.870
Shouldn't you say goodbye to Hayate?

02:10:20.830 --> 02:10:23.960
I don't want to make Master Hayate sad.

02:10:24.410 --> 02:10:25.870
But that's...

02:10:26.830 --> 02:10:28.590
That's so sad.

02:10:29.040 --> 02:10:31.420
You'll understand one day.

02:10:31.920 --> 02:10:38.140
When you meet someone for whom your love is as deep
as the sea and whose happiness you wish to protect.

02:10:51.020 --> 02:10:52.860
Let's get started.

02:10:54.030 --> 02:10:56.240
The Tome of the Night Sky's...

02:10:56.240 --> 02:10:57.530
final moments.

02:11:07.620 --> 02:11:09.670
Reinforce?

02:11:27.520 --> 02:11:28.980
Ready to set.

02:11:28.980 --> 02:11:30.610
Standby.

02:11:31.230 --> 02:11:32.480
Ah...

02:11:32.480 --> 02:11:36.490
I haven't known you two for very long,
but I thank you for your help.

02:11:36.950 --> 02:11:37.950
Don't worry.

02:11:38.280 --> 02:11:40.070
Have a good journey.

02:11:40.530 --> 02:11:41.370
I shall.

02:11:56.510 --> 02:11:57.800
Reinforce!

02:11:58.800 --> 02:12:00.260
Reinforce!

02:12:00.260 --> 02:12:01.300
Everyone!

02:12:02.640 --> 02:12:04.640
Hayate!

02:12:04.640 --> 02:12:05.470
Don't move!

02:12:05.810 --> 02:12:07.100
Stand still, please.

02:12:07.810 --> 02:12:08.980
The ritual would end.

02:12:11.770 --> 02:12:15.360
No, don't do that, Reinforce! Stop!

02:12:15.900 --> 02:12:19.610
You don't need to do this!
I'll control the Book!

02:12:19.610 --> 02:12:22.320
It'll be fine, so don't do this!

02:12:24.160 --> 02:12:25.700
Master Hayate...

02:12:26.240 --> 02:12:27.370
It's fine.

02:12:27.540 --> 02:12:30.960
No, it's not! It's not fine at all!

02:12:30.960 --> 02:12:32.330
Not at all!

02:12:33.460 --> 02:12:36.840
I've lived for a long time,

02:12:36.840 --> 02:12:40.180
but at the very end of my life,

02:12:40.180 --> 02:12:42.590
I received a beautiful name
and a heart from you.

02:12:43.300 --> 02:12:45.510
Even though our time was brief,

02:12:46.060 --> 02:12:47.850
I was able to soar through
the skies with you,

02:12:48.430 --> 02:12:50.940
and be your strength.

02:12:52.850 --> 02:12:56.900
And I can leave the knights with you.

02:12:57.530 --> 02:12:59.110
I have no regrets.

02:12:59.570 --> 02:13:01.950
I don't care about regrets.

02:13:02.450 --> 02:13:03.950
So I...

02:13:03.950 --> 02:13:05.580
I can go with a smile.

02:13:05.580 --> 02:13:09.200
Don't go! I'll figure something out!

02:13:09.200 --> 02:13:12.830
I promised you I wouldn't
let you go out of control!

02:13:12.830 --> 02:13:16.380
You've already kept that
promise magnificently.

02:13:16.380 --> 02:13:17.590
Reinforce!

02:13:18.000 --> 02:13:23.590
It's my duty as a magical vessel
to protect my master from harm.

02:13:24.140 --> 02:13:29.890
Please let me choose the
best way to protect you.

02:13:31.520 --> 02:13:32.690
But...

02:13:33.350 --> 02:13:35.860
we went through so much,

02:13:35.860 --> 02:13:39.990
and we finally got through it together!

02:13:40.610 --> 02:13:45.450
My will shall remain in your magic
and the souls of the knights.

02:13:46.120 --> 02:13:48.990
I shall always be by your side.

02:13:48.990 --> 02:13:52.410
That's not right! That's not what I want!

02:13:52.410 --> 02:13:54.870
It's no good to throw a fit.

02:13:55.380 --> 02:13:57.880
You must understand, Master.

02:14:00.420 --> 02:14:01.550
Reinforce!

02:14:08.260 --> 02:14:09.350
Why?

02:14:10.180 --> 02:14:13.020
This was just the beginning.

02:14:13.020 --> 02:14:17.110
I was going to make you happy.

02:14:20.610 --> 02:14:22.570
Don't worry.

02:14:22.570 --> 02:14:26.740
Right now, I am the happiest
magical tome there is.

02:14:27.780 --> 02:14:29.120
Reinforce...

02:14:34.620 --> 02:14:37.630
Master, may I make a request?

02:14:38.380 --> 02:14:43.050
I'll disappear and become a
small, powerless fragment.

02:14:43.630 --> 02:14:48.600
Will you please use my name,
not on that fragment,

02:14:48.600 --> 02:14:54.520
but on the new vessel
you shall receive one day?

02:14:58.560 --> 02:15:01.610
The Blessed Wind, Reinforce.

02:15:01.610 --> 02:15:04.900
My wishes will surely dwell within it.

02:15:06.530 --> 02:15:07.910
Reinforce...

02:15:08.740 --> 02:15:10.870
Yes, Master.

02:15:35.390 --> 02:15:37.060
Master Hayate...

02:15:37.730 --> 02:15:39.310
the guardian knights...

02:15:39.810 --> 02:15:43.320
and you young heroines...

02:15:43.860 --> 02:15:44.940
thank you.

02:16:53.890 --> 02:16:59.230
We'll be leaving the guardian knights with you.

02:16:59.640 --> 02:17:04.020
Monitoring them during their
interrogation and trial?

02:17:04.020 --> 02:17:07.940
But considering Hayate's situation...

02:17:07.940 --> 02:17:12.740
We're not planning to keep the four here,

02:17:12.740 --> 02:17:17.450
as long as they wear the
magic limiter and locator.

02:17:17.450 --> 02:17:18.330
Thank you.

02:17:19.000 --> 02:17:23.370
You can go report to your husband now, right?

02:17:23.370 --> 02:17:24.210
Going soon?

02:17:24.540 --> 02:17:27.380
Yeah, maybe next week...

02:17:27.380 --> 02:17:30.800
with Chrono, Fate, and Arf,
just the four of us.

02:17:30.800 --> 02:17:32.760
What'll you report?

02:17:32.760 --> 02:17:35.720
Well, probably the same as usual.

02:17:36.550 --> 02:17:39.930
"Many things happen every day,

02:17:39.930 --> 02:17:41.850
but we're doing fine."

02:17:42.520 --> 02:17:43.600
I see.

02:17:47.570 --> 02:17:50.490
That's how the case was resolved.

02:17:51.280 --> 02:17:55.450
Many things happened as the days flew by,

02:17:55.450 --> 02:17:57.740
bringing the end of December.

02:18:00.830 --> 02:18:02.250
Hayate was discharged.

02:18:02.870 --> 02:18:08.000
The four knights were interrogated by the TSAB.

02:18:08.000 --> 02:18:11.880
They're busy deciding
where they'll go from here.

02:18:17.680 --> 02:18:21.140
We'll be heading to HQ now.

02:18:21.140 --> 02:18:22.890
See you in the evening.

02:18:23.180 --> 02:18:26.650
Okay, I'll have dinner ready for you.

02:18:29.020 --> 02:18:31.860
Is tea okay? Make yourselves at home.

02:18:31.860 --> 02:18:33.280
I'll help you.

02:18:33.280 --> 02:18:33.950
Me too.

02:18:34.490 --> 02:18:36.450
Don't worry. Have a seat.

02:18:40.660 --> 02:18:44.370
So you'll be monitored too, Hayate?

02:18:44.830 --> 02:18:45.960
Yes.

02:18:45.960 --> 02:18:49.630
Now I want to learn how to
control and use magic.

02:18:50.210 --> 02:18:54.760
I'm a rather new mage compared to you two.

02:18:56.260 --> 02:19:01.310
I'm glad Signum and the others won't
be getting any severe punishment.

02:19:01.310 --> 02:19:02.140
Me too.

02:19:02.770 --> 02:19:06.020
But I still can't forgive myself.

02:19:06.520 --> 02:19:10.730
I should've realized all the
things about my body, Nacht,

02:19:10.730 --> 02:19:13.320
and their actions much sooner.

02:19:13.780 --> 02:19:16.860
I shouldn't regret the past,

02:19:16.860 --> 02:19:19.530
but we should own up to our mistakes.

02:19:20.070 --> 02:19:23.660
And I should lead them to a bright future.

02:19:25.580 --> 02:19:29.540
Oh, sorry. Was I rambling too much?

02:19:30.130 --> 02:19:31.090
No.

02:19:31.090 --> 02:19:35.170
You just sounded so mature, Hayate.

02:19:35.170 --> 02:19:35.920
Oh...

02:19:36.380 --> 02:19:40.850
Maybe that's because of Reinforce.

02:19:40.850 --> 02:19:41.680
I see.

02:19:42.310 --> 02:19:47.350
Reinforce's will and power
merged with you, right?

02:19:50.900 --> 02:19:51.860
Hayate?

02:19:52.400 --> 02:19:56.240
Sorry, it's nothing. Nothing at all.

02:19:56.860 --> 02:20:00.110
Ever since she left, my tears won't stop.

02:20:01.820 --> 02:20:05.120
Maybe she drew out my inner crybaby.

02:20:08.080 --> 02:20:10.880
Nanoha? Fate?

02:20:14.750 --> 02:20:16.840
It's okay to cry.

02:20:17.420 --> 02:20:22.510
Goodbyes are always sad,
so you can take all the time you need.

02:20:24.060 --> 02:20:26.640
It's just us here now.

02:20:26.640 --> 02:20:30.520
The knights you wish to protect aren't watching.

02:20:31.020 --> 02:20:32.980
We're with you.

02:20:32.980 --> 02:20:36.650
Reinforce won't be worried, either.

02:20:50.250 --> 02:20:54.040
It was probably a really small wish.

02:20:54.670 --> 02:20:57.760
A wish that couldn't be realized.

02:20:58.800 --> 02:21:01.430
The future's in our hands now.

02:21:02.970 --> 02:21:08.060
However much we may cry, what's past is past.

02:21:17.400 --> 02:21:19.070
But...

02:21:19.070 --> 02:21:22.950
with the strong will to shape the future...

02:21:25.950 --> 02:21:28.450
and the wings to fly in the boundless sky,

02:21:29.000 --> 02:21:30.580
we can

02:21:31.040 --> 02:21:32.040
make it.

02:21:43.510 --> 02:21:48.600
This is all that I know about the Book of Darkness Incident.

02:21:49.970 --> 02:21:56.150
The kind mages and the young master
all lived their days to the fullest.

02:21:58.150 --> 02:22:04.950
And the knights repented for their past mistakes
by protecting and saving the people.

02:22:04.950 --> 02:22:08.620
They were allowed to live with their master.

02:22:10.160 --> 02:22:15.500
And the will of the blessed wind
who crossed the winter night

02:22:16.130 --> 02:22:22.880
was inherited by a breeze born in the spring with the same name.

02:22:24.340 --> 02:22:25.430
<i>Reinforce...</i>

02:22:26.050 --> 02:22:28.890
<i>are you watching from the heavens?</i>

02:22:33.850 --> 02:22:35.100
Hey!

02:22:54.000 --> 02:22:55.790
Let's go, Rein.

02:22:56.540 --> 02:22:58.460
Yes, Meister Hayate!

02:23:02.300 --> 02:23:05.470
<i>We're always smiling now!</i>

02:23:09.470 --> 02:23:10.680
<i>And doing well!</i>

02:25:50.510 --> 02:25:51.920
Raising Heart.

02:25:52.260 --> 02:25:54.340
Yes, my master.

02:25:54.800 --> 02:25:55.760
Bardiche.

02:25:56.140 --> 02:25:57.100
Yes, sir.

02:25:57.510 --> 02:25:58.680
Reinforce.

02:25:59.350 --> 02:26:00.520
Yep!

02:26:07.650 --> 02:26:09.780
Stand by, Ready!

02:26:10.150 --> 02:26:14.780
Set up!
